WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:01:01.219 --> 00:01:03.555
- Something wrong
superintendent?


00:01:03.588 --> 00:01:05.991
- Absolutely not Robert.


00:01:07.124 --> 00:01:13.730
Please proceed.


00:01:17.867 --> 00:01:21.003
- There's nothing wrong with me.


00:01:21.036 --> 00:01:22.905
- Shh.


00:01:22.938 --> 00:01:25.840
Miss Puge we're
here to help you.


00:01:25.873 --> 00:01:27.675
No need to be afraid.


00:01:27.708 --> 00:01:29.544
The librium of the
scrotum as diagnosed...


00:01:29.576 --> 00:01:30.611
- Get on with it.


00:01:30.644 --> 00:01:31.245
- Miss Puge.


00:01:31.278 --> 00:01:32.179
- No.


00:01:32.212 --> 00:01:35.048
- No one is out to get you.


00:01:35.081 --> 00:01:38.684
You're safe, this is part
of your treatment here


00:01:38.717 --> 00:01:40.987
at Blackwell's Island.


00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:44.189
You do want to get
well, don't you?


00:01:46.724 --> 00:01:50.127
- No, no, no.


00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:51.295
No.


00:01:56.032 --> 00:01:58.001
- Feel better now don't you?


00:02:00.936 --> 00:02:03.539
- Mama.


00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:10.644
- Doctor Kinier.


00:02:10.677 --> 00:02:13.880
What's happening?


00:02:13.913 --> 00:02:16.181
- I don't know if I have enough.


00:02:33.729 --> 00:02:35.264
- Can you hear me?


00:02:35.297 --> 00:02:36.732
Talk to me.


00:02:36.765 --> 00:02:38.101
- Enough!


00:02:41.703 --> 00:02:45.639
Send her to the crematorium.


00:02:45.672 --> 00:02:47.775
I will make out the papers.


00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:34.663
- I wasn't
always known as Nellie Bly.


00:04:34.696 --> 00:04:37.265
I was born Elizabeth Cockringe
during the Civil War,


00:04:37.298 --> 00:04:39.200
outside of Pittsburgh,
Pennsylvania.


00:04:39.233 --> 00:04:42.302
Since I was a child, I
wanted to be a reporter.


00:04:42.335 --> 00:04:45.105
It'd been two years since I
wrote the Pittsburgh Dispatch,


00:04:45.138 --> 00:04:48.174
to criticize an article that
mocked women looking for work.


00:04:48.207 --> 00:04:51.077
The managing editor was so
impressed with my response,


00:04:51.110 --> 00:04:53.145
that he made the rare
choice of hiring me,


00:04:53.178 --> 00:04:56.081
a female to work as a reporter.


00:04:56.114 --> 00:04:59.350
You see in 1887, journalism
was a man's world,


00:04:59.383 --> 00:05:02.687
an exclusive,
albeit, crusty cigar,


00:05:02.720 --> 00:05:04.754
and spittoon filled club.


00:05:04.787 --> 00:05:06.189
The women were not welcomed.


00:05:06.222 --> 00:05:07.424
- Nellie Bly.


00:05:07.457 --> 00:05:08.757
We were
considered too dainty


00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:10.859
and fragile for such work.


00:05:10.892 --> 00:05:13.395
So how did I, the
fabled mere woman,


00:05:13.428 --> 00:05:15.763
fair sex, a faint heart,


00:05:15.796 --> 00:05:19.233
become the most known investigative reporter in the world.


00:05:19.266 --> 00:05:21.702
Well, I have always believed


00:05:21.735 --> 00:05:24.037
that energy rightly
applied and directed...


00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:25.172
- Come in.


00:05:25.205 --> 00:05:27.173
Will
accomplish anything.


00:05:30.409 --> 00:05:33.344
- Nellie Bly I'd like to
introduce you to our publisher,


00:05:33.377 --> 00:05:35.714
Joseph Pulitzer.


00:05:37.881 --> 00:05:40.117
- It's very nice to
meet you Mr. Pulitzer.


00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:42.019
It is a great honor.


00:05:45.187 --> 00:05:46.923
- Bly is not your real name.


00:05:46.956 --> 00:05:49.791
- No, Nellie Bly is my pen name.


00:05:49.824 --> 00:05:50.859
- She is small.


00:05:50.892 --> 00:05:51.860
- But plucky.


00:05:51.893 --> 00:05:53.028
- Is that enough?


00:05:53.061 --> 00:05:54.795
- Her recommendation
is impeccable.


00:05:54.828 --> 00:05:55.896
Her reputation is outstanding.


00:05:55.929 --> 00:05:57.798
I believe she was made for this.


00:05:57.831 --> 00:05:58.999
- She is unknown.


00:05:59.032 --> 00:06:05.706
If this fails, it is not her
reputation that is on the line.


00:06:09.241 --> 00:06:12.276
- I would live to thank you
for the advance, Mr. Cokerill.


00:06:12.309 --> 00:06:14.312
I am ready for any opportunity
the World Newspaper


00:06:14.345 --> 00:06:16.114
has for me.


00:06:16.147 --> 00:06:17.814
- I've spoken with Mr. Pulitzer


00:06:17.847 --> 00:06:19.983
about some of the
ideas you suggested.


00:06:20.016 --> 00:06:21.485
- Oh.


00:06:21.518 --> 00:06:23.320
- Would you really have
gone up in a balloon?


00:06:23.353 --> 00:06:25.121
- Without question.


00:06:25.154 --> 00:06:28.090
You gave the assignment to
a male reporter instead,


00:06:28.123 --> 00:06:30.458
I would have drawn
greater sensation.


00:06:30.491 --> 00:06:33.194
- No doubt.


00:06:33.227 --> 00:06:36.363
But we have another idea,


00:06:36.396 --> 00:06:38.298
the World Newspaper would
like you to infiltrate


00:06:38.331 --> 00:06:43.002
one of the asylums for the
insane in New York City.


00:06:44.236 --> 00:06:46.105
- To report on the
treatment of the patients?


00:06:46.138 --> 00:06:47.539
- Yes.


00:06:47.572 --> 00:06:49.207
- Which asylum?


00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:53.944
- Blackwell's Island
Lunatic Asylum for Women.


00:06:53.977 --> 00:06:56.113
- To get in, I will
have to be committed.


00:06:56.146 --> 00:06:59.949
- We can find a doctor who'd
be willing to sign the papers.


00:06:59.982 --> 00:07:02.485
- No I'll have to do it myself.


00:07:02.518 --> 00:07:04.953
The only sure way
I am not revealed


00:07:04.986 --> 00:07:07.957
is absolutely everyone
must believe I am insane.


00:07:09.857 --> 00:07:13.261
How will you get me out
after I once get in?


00:07:13.294 --> 00:07:16.196
- I do not know.


00:07:16.229 --> 00:07:18.298
It will be quite dangerous.


00:07:18.331 --> 00:07:20.100
- I have faith in my abilities.


00:07:20.133 --> 00:07:21.901
- No doubt you have
faith in your abilities


00:07:21.934 --> 00:07:23.836
to deceive the insanity experts,


00:07:23.869 --> 00:07:26.539
I fear they cannot be deceived.


00:07:26.572 --> 00:07:28.973
- I will teach myself to be mad.


00:07:29.006 --> 00:07:31.276
- It is vital that
you not be revealed,


00:07:31.309 --> 00:07:33.410
your very life
may be threatened.


00:07:33.443 --> 00:07:35.145
- I am not afraid of danger.


00:07:35.178 --> 00:07:36.947
- And how do we truly
test the competency


00:07:36.980 --> 00:07:40.116
of the doctors and nurses.


00:07:40.149 --> 00:07:41.851
- The answer is simple,


00:07:41.884 --> 00:07:44.352
I will be insane long
enough to get committed,


00:07:44.385 --> 00:07:47.889
but from the moment I enter
the insane ward on the island,


00:07:47.922 --> 00:07:52.026
I will talk and act just
as I do in ordinary life.


00:07:54.161 --> 00:07:56.329
Then it is decided.


00:07:58.931 --> 00:08:01.034
- It is decided.


00:08:01.067 --> 00:08:03.569
- I shall feign insanity
have myself committed


00:08:03.602 --> 00:08:05.838
to Blackwell's Lunatic Asylum.


00:08:05.871 --> 00:08:07.572
Yes.


00:08:07.605 --> 00:08:09.574
Uh, just one more thing.


00:08:09.607 --> 00:08:10.975
- What is it?


00:08:11.008 --> 00:08:13.610
- I am afraid of that
chronic smile of yours.


00:08:13.643 --> 00:08:17.080
- I will smile no more.


00:08:26.554 --> 00:08:28.289
- After
receiving my instructions,


00:08:28.322 --> 00:08:29.924
I returned to my boarding house.


00:08:29.957 --> 00:08:31.124
And in front of the mirror,


00:08:31.157 --> 00:08:34.394
I began to practice the role
in which I was to make my debut


00:08:34.427 --> 00:08:37.564
to convince the world
that I was insane.


00:09:14.227 --> 00:09:15.996
I turned the gas up high,


00:09:16.029 --> 00:09:17.997
in hopes that it
would raise my courage


00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:19.899
against the thought that
I about to be locked away


00:09:19.932 --> 00:09:23.368
in a mad house, with no
clear way to get out.


00:09:46.687 --> 00:09:48.389
I quietly bathed fair well


00:09:48.422 --> 00:09:51.258
to the precious comforts
of modern civilization.


00:09:53.225 --> 00:09:55.128
It may be for days.


00:09:55.161 --> 00:09:57.129
It may be for longer.


00:09:57.162 --> 00:10:00.399
I took a last fond look
at myself as a sane woman.


00:10:00.432 --> 00:10:03.034
Who could tell, but that
the strain of playing crazy


00:10:03.067 --> 00:10:05.069
might burn my own brain


00:10:05.102 --> 00:10:07.338
and I would never get back.


00:10:11.174 --> 00:10:13.410
I decided to start my
mission at a temporary home


00:10:13.443 --> 00:10:16.412
for working women.


00:10:16.445 --> 00:10:18.547
My objective was to make
this house full of women


00:10:18.580 --> 00:10:20.281
believe me crazy,


00:10:20.314 --> 00:10:23.384
so they would never rest
until I was out of there reach


00:10:23.417 --> 00:10:26.053
and in secure quartets.


00:10:27.487 --> 00:10:29.523
- Well what do you want?


00:10:29.556 --> 00:10:31.657
- I want to stay
here for a few days,


00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:33.993
if you can accommodate me.


00:10:34.026 --> 00:10:36.429
- Well I have no single
rooms, we are so crowded.


00:10:36.462 --> 00:10:38.430
But if you will occupy a
room with another girl,


00:10:38.463 --> 00:10:39.631
I shall grant you that much.


00:10:39.664 --> 00:10:41.299
- I shall be glad of that.


00:10:41.332 --> 00:10:42.634
How much do you charge?


00:10:42.667 --> 00:10:46.337
- Thirty cents a night.


00:10:50.740 --> 00:10:55.611
Move along.


00:10:59.347 --> 00:11:02.049
So now I was
amongst these honest workers,


00:11:02.082 --> 00:11:03.718
the most deserving of women.


00:11:03.751 --> 00:11:06.686
I selected them as the ones
to work out my salvation,


00:11:06.719 --> 00:11:09.122
or more properly speaking,


00:11:09.155 --> 00:11:12.491
my condemnation and conviction
into the insane asylum.


00:11:19.497 --> 00:11:21.699
- Shhh.


00:11:21.732 --> 00:11:24.001
Shhh!


00:11:24.034 --> 00:11:24.768
Shhh!


00:11:42.049 --> 00:11:43.584
- What's wrong with you?


00:11:43.617 --> 00:11:45.419
Have you some
sorrow or troubled?


00:11:45.452 --> 00:11:47.453
- No why?


00:11:47.486 --> 00:11:51.457
- Oh because I can
see it in your face.


00:11:51.490 --> 00:11:55.127
What kind of work are
you trying to get?


00:11:56.661 --> 00:11:59.363
- I never worked,
I don't know how.


00:11:59.396 --> 00:12:02.567
- But you must learn,
all these women work.


00:12:04.133 --> 00:12:07.203
- Do they?


00:12:07.236 --> 00:12:10.672
Oh why they all
look horrible to me.


00:12:10.705 --> 00:12:15.209
Just like crazy women.


00:12:15.242 --> 00:12:18.279
There's so many
crazy people about.


00:12:25.618 --> 00:12:27.219
It
was amusing to see


00:12:27.252 --> 00:12:29.388
what remarkably short time it
took to get up from her chair


00:12:29.421 --> 00:12:32.223
and hurriedly move away
from the crazy girl.


00:12:32.256 --> 00:12:33.658
I knew my performance
had hit home.


00:12:47.536 --> 00:12:49.272
- So I said to the supervisor,


00:12:49.305 --> 00:12:51.640
that it's just not right
to keep this place so cold.


00:12:51.673 --> 00:12:54.142
I mean if they want
us to produce faster,


00:12:54.175 --> 00:12:56.143
they really ought to invest
in a couple sticks of wood


00:12:56.176 --> 00:12:59.547
for the stove, don't you agree?


00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:02.549
- I don't know, I cannot say.


00:13:02.582 --> 00:13:06.720
Oh yes, I mean no, I don't know.


00:13:07.686 --> 00:13:10.689
Oh is it suddenly hot in here?


00:13:10.722 --> 00:13:13.691
I know nothing about
the boats to Boston.


00:13:13.724 --> 00:13:16.160
I have to find my trunks!


00:13:16.193 --> 00:13:18.562
- It's time for bed ladies.


00:13:19.629 --> 00:13:21.164
- Oh I'm afraid.


00:13:21.197 --> 00:13:22.299
Can I not sit by
the stairs tonight?


00:13:22.332 --> 00:13:23.667
- No!


00:13:25.501 --> 00:13:31.239
Everyone in the house will
think that you're crazy.


00:13:35.510 --> 00:13:36.510
- This way Miss Brown.


00:13:36.543 --> 00:13:40.114
- No, this is my room.


00:13:40.147 --> 00:13:41.814
I will not stay with
that crazy woman


00:13:41.847 --> 00:13:43.783
for all the money
in the Vanderbelts.


00:13:43.816 --> 00:13:45.585
My
act was working.


00:13:45.618 --> 00:13:48.720
The women were afraid of me.


00:13:48.753 --> 00:13:50.622
- I can't have her
scaring you all off.


00:13:50.655 --> 00:13:51.656
I'll send for a policeman


00:13:51.689 --> 00:13:53.224
and have her taken away at once.


00:13:53.257 --> 00:13:55.226
Go fetch a policeman
from the corner.


00:13:55.259 --> 00:13:57.728
- No she can stay in my room.


00:13:57.761 --> 00:14:00.396
- There's only one bed, I don't
have time to set up another.


00:14:00.429 --> 00:14:01.731
- That'll be fine.


00:14:01.764 --> 00:14:03.233
- Only this
one woman among the crowd,


00:14:03.266 --> 00:14:04.633
pretty and delicate
Mrs. Caine...


00:14:04.666 --> 00:14:06.168
- Suit yourself.


00:14:06.201 --> 00:14:11.506
- Displayed
true compassionate feeling.


00:14:15.809 --> 00:14:17.410
She smoothed my hair


00:14:17.443 --> 00:14:19.679
and talked as soothingly
to me as a mother would do


00:14:19.712 --> 00:14:20.881
to a sick child.


00:14:20.914 --> 00:14:23.682
- I don't remember
much about my mother,


00:14:23.715 --> 00:14:28.486
but I always remember her
combing through my hair


00:14:28.519 --> 00:14:31.323
and getting me ready for bed.


00:14:34.891 --> 00:14:36.793
Let's get you out of that
dress and ready for bed.


00:14:36.826 --> 00:14:38.462
- No!


00:14:40.362 --> 00:14:41.697
They're going to kill me.


00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:43.900
- Who's going to kill you?


00:14:43.933 --> 00:14:45.333
- I will not take off my dress.


00:14:45.366 --> 00:14:46.635
- Perhaps if you just
lie down on the bed


00:14:46.668 --> 00:14:47.636
with your clothes on...


00:14:47.669 --> 00:14:48.804
- No!


00:14:50.537 --> 00:14:52.773
- Here look, I will
lie down on the bed


00:14:52.806 --> 00:14:55.276
with my clothes on as
well, be ready with you.


00:14:55.309 --> 00:14:59.813
- I will not.


00:15:04.282 --> 00:15:08.686
- Do try to rest dear.


00:15:26.534 --> 00:15:31.371
- You're still awake,
lively as a cricket.


00:15:31.404 --> 00:15:34.241
- I have to find my luggage.


00:15:34.274 --> 00:15:35.842
- Oh dear, you have been
up on your feet all night,


00:15:35.875 --> 00:15:37.476
you must be exhausted.


00:15:37.509 --> 00:15:40.279
Though Mrs. Caine
grew more and more anxious..


00:15:40.312 --> 00:15:41.747
- Sit and rest poor thing.


00:15:41.780 --> 00:15:45.550
She was
as sympathetic as ever.


00:15:45.583 --> 00:15:48.552
Poor soul, how cruelly
I tortured her.


00:15:48.585 --> 00:15:50.287
- I have trunks.


00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:52.289
Where are they? I want them.


00:15:52.322 --> 00:15:53.490
I want them.


00:15:53.523 --> 00:15:56.426
And what
a kind heart she had.


00:15:56.459 --> 00:15:58.261
- I'll see if there's
any more of them.


00:16:12.605 --> 00:16:15.642
- How much I admired
her courage and kindness,


00:16:15.675 --> 00:16:16.843
how I longed to reassure her


00:16:16.876 --> 00:16:19.812
and whisper that
I was not insane.


00:16:19.845 --> 00:16:21.880
How I hoped that
if any poor girl


00:16:21.913 --> 00:16:23.715
should ever be so
unfortunate as to be


00:16:23.748 --> 00:16:25.350
what I was pretending to be...


00:16:25.383 --> 00:16:26.484
- Poor child.


00:16:26.517 --> 00:16:27.685
She
might meet with one


00:16:27.718 --> 00:16:30.420
who possessed the same
spirit of human kindness


00:16:30.453 --> 00:16:31.889
as Mrs. Ruth Caine.


00:16:34.490 --> 00:16:38.394
- Yes I believe the
poor dear is insane.


00:16:47.567 --> 00:16:48.869
- I want you to
take her quietly.


00:16:48.902 --> 00:16:50.604
- If she don't go quietly,


00:16:50.637 --> 00:16:51.971
I will drag her
through the streets.


00:16:52.004 --> 00:16:54.707
- I certainly wish to avoid
raising a scandal outside.


00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:56.409
- There's no need for
that kind of brutality.


00:16:56.442 --> 00:16:57.876
- I'll handle this.


00:16:57.909 --> 00:17:00.646
We'll take her along quietly.


00:17:01.613 --> 00:17:03.514
Well hello there sweet girl.


00:17:03.547 --> 00:17:04.749
If you would like
to come with me,


00:17:04.782 --> 00:17:07.351
I'll help you find
your lost effects.


00:17:07.384 --> 00:17:08.653
- Who are you?


00:17:08.686 --> 00:17:09.886
I don't know you.


00:17:09.919 --> 00:17:11.655
- He's a policeman love.


00:17:11.688 --> 00:17:12.822
He means you no harm,


00:17:12.855 --> 00:17:15.491
he's going to help
you find your things.


00:17:15.524 --> 00:17:17.993
- I don't want to
go with him alone.


00:17:18.026 --> 00:17:19.528
I do not know him.


00:17:19.561 --> 00:17:21.496
- You don't have to go with
him if you don't want to.


00:17:21.529 --> 00:17:23.598
- I will help you
find your trunks.


00:17:23.631 --> 00:17:26.034
We can find them together.


00:17:26.066 --> 00:17:27.501
- You will?


00:17:27.534 --> 00:17:29.603
- Of course, they couldn't
have got very far.


00:17:29.636 --> 00:17:30.671
Now you just come along with me.


00:17:39.677 --> 00:17:41.913
Follow us at a
respectable distance.


00:17:41.946 --> 00:17:48.519
- These policeman
are here to help you.


00:17:56.424 --> 00:17:58.060
The
skies were overcast


00:17:58.093 --> 00:18:01.062
as I was taken to the
S6 Market Police Court.


00:18:01.095 --> 00:18:03.597
Where at last, the
question of my sanity,


00:18:03.630 --> 00:18:06.433
or insanity was to be decided.


00:18:06.466 --> 00:18:08.335
- Sir, sir, please help me sir.


00:18:08.368 --> 00:18:09.436
- Step back.


00:18:09.469 --> 00:18:11.338
- Here's the express house.


00:18:11.371 --> 00:18:13.639
We're all here to help
you find your trunks.


00:18:13.672 --> 00:18:16.008
- All these people
lost their trunks?


00:18:16.041 --> 00:18:18.676
- Yes apparently all of
them have lost their trunks.


00:18:18.709 --> 00:18:20.545
- I don't know what
to do with the child.


00:18:20.578 --> 00:18:21.813
She must be taken care of.


00:18:21.846 --> 00:18:22.780
Send
her to the island.


00:18:22.813 --> 00:18:24.815
- No, oh don't, don't.


00:18:24.848 --> 00:18:28.018
She is a lady, it would kill
her to go to the island.


00:18:28.051 --> 00:18:29.719
- Perhaps you're right.


00:18:29.752 --> 00:18:32.088
There is some foul work here,


00:18:32.121 --> 00:18:36.524
I believe this girl has been
drugged and brought to the city


00:18:36.557 --> 00:18:37.826
make out the papers,


00:18:37.859 --> 00:18:40.562
we'll send her to
Belview for examination.


00:18:40.595 --> 00:18:41.995
And probably in a few days,


00:18:42.028 --> 00:18:43.630
the effect of the
drug will wear off


00:18:43.663 --> 00:18:46.633
and she'll be able to tell us
a story that'll be startling.


00:18:46.666 --> 00:18:49.836
- I do not wish to stay here
any longer to be gazed at.


00:18:49.869 --> 00:18:54.740
- Take her to my office.


00:18:59.009 --> 00:19:01.445
- Put out your tongue.


00:19:02.813 --> 00:19:04.581
I said put out your tongue.


00:19:04.614 --> 00:19:05.882
- I don't want to.


00:19:05.915 --> 00:19:07.650
- But you are sick
and I am a doctor.


00:19:07.683 --> 00:19:12.021
- I am not sick, I
just want my trunks.


00:19:16.724 --> 00:19:23.997
- Open.


00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:29.735
Take a deep breath.


00:19:39.509 --> 00:19:40.744
Alright.


00:19:40.777 --> 00:19:42.613
Look at my hand.


00:19:45.681 --> 00:19:48.017
Follow my hand.


00:19:48.050 --> 00:19:52.688
And again.


00:19:56.657 --> 00:19:57.992
I believe she's
taken Belladonna.


00:19:58.025 --> 00:19:59.794
- I'm not in the least ill.


00:19:59.827 --> 00:20:01.995
I've never been sick and no
one has the right to detain me


00:20:02.028 --> 00:20:04.931
when I want to find my trunks.


00:20:04.964 --> 00:20:06.433
I want to go home.


00:20:06.466 --> 00:20:08.901
- And I will take you home.


00:20:10.802 --> 00:20:12.905
- I am so glad to go with you.


00:20:12.938 --> 00:20:14.505
I began
to have more confidence


00:20:14.538 --> 00:20:16.908
in my own ability to
play a mad woman now,


00:20:16.941 --> 00:20:19.776
since one judge, one
doctor, and a mass of people


00:20:19.809 --> 00:20:21.812
had pronounced me insane.


00:20:25.981 --> 00:20:27.483
I shall never forget that ride


00:20:27.516 --> 00:20:29.685
to the insane pavilion
at Belview Hospital.


00:20:31.752 --> 00:20:33.788
It was at the hospital
that I was to be processed


00:20:33.821 --> 00:20:36.523
and my fate sealed
regarding my commitment


00:20:36.556 --> 00:20:38.526
to Blackwell's Island Asylum.


00:20:40.193 --> 00:20:42.595
- This girl is to wait here.


00:20:45.965 --> 00:20:47.633
- Oh please do not go.


00:20:47.666 --> 00:20:50.469
Please do not leave
me here, I beg you.


00:20:50.502 --> 00:20:52.838
Oh take me with you.


00:20:52.871 --> 00:20:54.939
You said that you
would take me home.


00:20:54.972 --> 00:20:58.776
- I have to assist
with an amputation.


00:21:01.244 --> 00:21:03.547
- Those noisy commoners.


00:21:07.015 --> 00:21:09.051
- I do not want to
stay here without you.


00:21:09.084 --> 00:21:10.586
- I'll be back soon, I promise.


00:21:10.619 --> 00:21:12.119
- To take me home?


00:21:12.152 --> 00:21:13.554
- Yes.


00:21:13.587 --> 00:21:15.223
At last, I
found myself an occupant


00:21:15.256 --> 00:21:17.090
of an insane asylum.


00:21:19.659 --> 00:21:22.595
I already felt like
a woman condemned.


00:21:24.530 --> 00:21:27.733
- Hello, I'd like
to introduce myself.


00:21:27.766 --> 00:21:29.935
My name is Nellie Brown.


00:21:33.604 --> 00:21:35.239
I'm here waiting for
a nice gentleman,


00:21:35.272 --> 00:21:40.743
who is going to
come take me home.


00:21:45.047 --> 00:21:49.485
- I'm Ann Neville.


00:21:53.020 --> 00:21:55.990
This is not a place
that you want wait long,


00:21:56.023 --> 00:21:58.825
if you don't need to be here.


00:21:58.858 --> 00:22:01.728
This is a place of the sick.


00:22:01.761 --> 00:22:03.862
- Are you sick?


00:22:03.895 --> 00:22:05.197
- Yes.


00:22:09.233 --> 00:22:11.168
- How did you come to be here?


00:22:11.201 --> 00:22:15.138
- I was working as a chamber
maid in a large house,


00:22:15.171 --> 00:22:16.940
when my health gave away.


00:22:16.973 --> 00:22:20.042
I was sent to a sister's
home to be treated.


00:22:20.075 --> 00:22:23.012
My nephew is out of work.


00:22:23.045 --> 00:22:26.581
Being unable to pay my
expenses at my home,


00:22:26.614 --> 00:22:29.551
he had me transferred
here to Belview.


00:22:37.157 --> 00:22:39.892
- Is there anything
wrong with you mentally?


00:22:39.925 --> 00:22:41.294
- No.


00:22:42.861 --> 00:22:46.131
The doctors have been asking
me many dubious questions


00:22:46.164 --> 00:22:48.199
and confusing me,


00:22:48.232 --> 00:22:52.069
but there's nothing
wrong with my brain.


00:22:52.102 --> 00:22:53.837
- Do you know that
only insane people


00:22:53.870 --> 00:22:54.904
are sent to this pavilion?


00:22:54.937 --> 00:22:58.775
- Yes, I know.


00:22:58.808 --> 00:23:01.243
But the doctors refuse
to listen to me,


00:23:01.276 --> 00:23:04.680
it's useless to say
anything to the nurses.


00:23:08.949 --> 00:23:11.185
- Let me hold the baby.


00:23:48.348 --> 00:23:50.184
- Nellie Brown,
the doctor is here.


00:23:50.217 --> 00:23:52.319
He wishes to speak with you.


00:23:56.122 --> 00:23:57.990
- How are you feeling Nellie?


00:23:59.424 --> 00:24:03.061
- Oh I feel alright.


00:24:03.094 --> 00:24:05.663
But you
are sick you know?


00:24:05.696 --> 00:24:06.330
- Am I?


00:24:06.363 --> 00:24:07.932
- Yes.


00:24:07.965 --> 00:24:10.066
Tell me why did you think the
women in the temporary home


00:24:10.099 --> 00:24:11.301
were going to harm you.


00:24:11.334 --> 00:24:13.737
- Temporary home, I...


00:24:13.770 --> 00:24:15.204
What temporary home?


00:24:15.237 --> 00:24:16.805
- You did not stay in a temporary home for working women?


00:24:16.838 --> 00:24:19.808
- No, I've never
stayed in such a place.


00:24:19.841 --> 00:24:21.843
- What was the name of the
judge presiding over your case?


00:24:21.876 --> 00:24:24.345
- I do not remember going
in front of a judge.


00:24:24.378 --> 00:24:27.381
- I see, what is
your father's name?


00:24:31.418 --> 00:24:33.219
- I cannot remember.


00:24:33.252 --> 00:24:34.988
- What is your mother's name?


00:24:37.990 --> 00:24:39.224
- I cannot remember.


00:24:39.257 --> 00:24:42.093
- Any brothers or
sisters, aunts or uncles?


00:24:42.126 --> 00:24:43.228
- I cannot remember.


00:24:43.261 --> 00:24:45.095
- Calm down Miss
Brown, calm down.


00:24:45.128 --> 00:24:46.931
It's fine.


00:24:48.932 --> 00:24:53.036
Do you not have a lover
that casts you aside?


00:24:53.069 --> 00:24:54.237
- No.


00:24:54.270 --> 00:24:55.238
- Now what street was
the temporary home,


00:24:55.271 --> 00:24:56.938
you stayed at, located?


00:24:56.971 --> 00:24:59.274
- I did not stay at
any temporary home!


00:24:59.307 --> 00:25:01.375
- Alright, that's
fine Miss Brown.


00:25:01.408 --> 00:25:04.078
Try to get some rest, alright.


00:25:08.347 --> 00:25:09.416
Not once,


00:25:09.449 --> 00:25:10.817
did it cross the
admitting doctor's mind


00:25:10.850 --> 00:25:12.751
that I might not be
telling him the truth.


00:25:12.784 --> 00:25:14.253
Based on such an examination,


00:25:14.286 --> 00:25:15.754
I doubt any doctor could tell


00:25:15.787 --> 00:25:18.257
whether people
are insane or not.


00:25:33.135 --> 00:25:35.271
- Ow, ah!


00:25:35.304 --> 00:25:38.406
Ow, ow, you are trimming
my nails to the quick.


00:25:38.439 --> 00:25:41.109
- It is for everyone's safety.


00:25:42.976 --> 00:25:44.478
- Miss Scott, Miss Scott,


00:25:44.511 --> 00:25:46.880
there's a gentleman here
from the Sun Newspaper


00:25:46.913 --> 00:25:48.214
to interview Miss Brown.


00:25:48.247 --> 00:25:51.150
- No one is to see
the transfer patients.


00:25:51.183 --> 00:25:53.218
- I had to
summon all of my courage,


00:25:53.251 --> 00:25:56.788
as I was marched to the
boat to Blackwell's Asylum;


00:25:56.821 --> 00:26:00.324
an insane place, where
women never get out.


00:26:36.954 --> 00:26:42.359
- Come with me.


00:26:50.166 --> 00:26:52.934
- Feet flat on the
floor at all times.


00:27:02.842 --> 00:27:05.178
- Voiceover] It's strange
how after all of my bravery,


00:27:05.211 --> 00:27:07.947
I felt a chill at being locked
up with fellow creatures,


00:27:07.980 --> 00:27:09.815
who were truly insane.


00:27:09.848 --> 00:27:16.521
Come here to bed.


00:27:20.924 --> 00:27:23.493
- I had recently been ill.


00:27:23.526 --> 00:27:26.495
It lasted so long, I suffered
from nervous stability.


00:27:26.528 --> 00:27:30.166
But I only had fever
thinking, while I was ill.


00:27:31.532 --> 00:27:33.434
I do not belong here.


00:27:33.467 --> 00:27:35.837
I have recovered.


00:27:35.870 --> 00:27:38.972
- I will decide your diagnosis.


00:27:39.005 --> 00:27:40.374
- Please,


00:27:40.407 --> 00:27:43.876
try all your tests for
insanity if you have any,


00:27:43.909 --> 00:27:45.545
I do not belong here.


00:27:45.578 --> 00:27:47.413
- Everyone who enters
here makes that claim.


00:27:47.446 --> 00:27:49.514
- Please give me justice.


00:27:49.547 --> 00:27:51.516
- Justice?


00:27:51.549 --> 00:27:53.251
- Justice refers to the law,


00:27:53.284 --> 00:27:56.854
you speak as if you're
entering a prison.


00:27:56.887 --> 00:27:58.856
But this is a hospital,


00:27:58.889 --> 00:28:00.323
we're here to help you.


00:28:00.356 --> 00:28:02.926
- Please, I beg you.


00:28:02.959 --> 00:28:04.994
You not need worry Miss Mayard,


00:28:05.027 --> 00:28:07.963
we'll get you the help you need.


00:28:14.268 --> 00:28:16.003
- I'm so frightened.


00:28:16.036 --> 00:28:17.337
He didn't listen to me at all.


00:28:17.370 --> 00:28:19.005
Mrs. Louise Shanz.


00:28:19.038 --> 00:28:22.142
- I will try by every means
to be a benefit to you.


00:28:22.175 --> 00:28:24.911
- What can you do?


00:28:27.379 --> 00:28:29.514
- Doctor please, you do
not understand what...


00:28:29.547 --> 00:28:33.284
You're name?


00:28:35.986 --> 00:28:38.455
- Miss Grupe, you're German.


00:28:38.488 --> 00:28:41.825
Ask her what her husband does.


00:28:48.096 --> 00:28:52.900
- Her husband is a craftsman.


00:28:54.034 --> 00:28:55.336
- Very well.


00:28:55.369 --> 00:28:57.037
Mrs. Louise Schanz is admitted


00:28:57.070 --> 00:28:58.171
to Blackwell's
Island Insane Asylum.


00:28:58.204 --> 00:29:00.139
- No this is not right.


00:29:13.217 --> 00:29:14.519
- Miss Anne Neville.


00:29:15.652 --> 00:29:17.487
- Can you tell me your name?


00:29:17.520 --> 00:29:19.189
- Yes.


00:29:20.989 --> 00:29:21.924
- What is it?


00:29:21.957 --> 00:29:26.294
- You don't know or are
you seeing if I know?


00:29:29.664 --> 00:29:31.466
What are you writing?


00:29:31.499 --> 00:29:32.900
- I ask the questions.


00:29:32.933 --> 00:29:34.301
Like the others,


00:29:34.334 --> 00:29:37.638
the poor girl was condemned
to the insane asylum for life.


00:29:37.671 --> 00:29:39.138
- Anne Neville.


00:29:39.171 --> 00:29:40.106
- Without being
given one feeble chance


00:29:40.139 --> 00:29:41.274
to prove her sanity.


00:29:41.307 --> 00:29:44.376
- Nellie Brown the
doctor wants you.


00:29:44.409 --> 00:29:46.378
- As
according to my plan,


00:29:46.411 --> 00:29:48.313
the moment I
entered Blackwell's,


00:29:48.346 --> 00:29:50.514
I dropped my act of insanity


00:29:50.547 --> 00:29:53.050
and acted just as I
do in every day life.


00:29:53.083 --> 00:29:54.585
What is your name?


00:29:54.618 --> 00:29:56.553
- Nellie Brown.


00:29:58.554 --> 00:30:00.923
- What's the color of her eyes?


00:30:00.956 --> 00:30:02.258
- Gray.


00:30:03.158 --> 00:30:05.027
What is your age?


00:30:05.060 --> 00:30:07.495
- Nineteen last may.


00:30:10.564 --> 00:30:12.599
- When do you get
your next pass?


00:30:12.632 --> 00:30:15.001
- Next Saturday is
my next day off.


00:30:15.034 --> 00:30:16.269
- You will go into town?


00:30:16.302 --> 00:30:19.338
Yeah.


00:30:19.371 --> 00:30:24.542
- Measure her.


00:30:29.146 --> 00:30:30.915
What is it?


00:30:33.650 --> 00:30:35.352
- Now you know I can't tell.


00:30:35.385 --> 00:30:37.420
- Yes you can, now
look and tell me.


00:30:37.453 --> 00:30:39.522
- I can't, do it yourself.


00:30:51.732 --> 00:30:54.400
- Five feet, five inches.


00:30:54.433 --> 00:30:57.036
Don't you see?


00:30:57.069 --> 00:31:00.572
- Oh yeah, I see now.


00:31:04.209 --> 00:31:06.077
- Now...


00:31:08.579 --> 00:31:11.548
That will do, I'm
finished with her.


00:31:14.684 --> 00:31:17.519
- I am not sick and I do
not want to stay here.


00:31:17.552 --> 00:31:19.188
- That'll do Miss Gruper.


00:31:19.221 --> 00:31:22.056
- No one has a right to
shut me up in this manner.


00:31:28.428 --> 00:31:30.965
- Bath time single file!


00:31:31.464 --> 00:31:32.766
Girl undress.


00:31:32.799 --> 00:31:34.500
- I think I shall not.


00:31:34.533 --> 00:31:37.036
I've never bathed in this
manner in front of others.


00:31:37.069 --> 00:31:39.504
And it is too cold
to bathe tonight.


00:31:39.537 --> 00:31:42.073
Why can't we wait until
day time when it is warm?


00:31:42.106 --> 00:31:44.742
- Nellie Brown, either you
remove your clothing right now


00:31:44.775 --> 00:31:47.211
or we will undress you.


00:31:51.080 --> 00:31:52.548
Very well.


00:31:52.581 --> 00:31:57.052
Miss Grupe.


00:32:09.162 --> 00:32:11.665
- No, no.


00:32:16.134 --> 00:32:20.372
I will not remove it.


00:32:25.075 --> 00:32:26.677
No.


00:32:42.189 --> 00:32:44.458
It's so cold, I cannot stand it.


00:32:47.160 --> 00:32:49.696
No, no my hair,
please no my hair.


00:33:18.619 --> 00:33:20.188
- Next.


00:33:21.789 --> 00:33:23.824
I'm ill, I
have been sick with a cough.


00:33:23.857 --> 00:33:27.428
My chest, I cannot
get into cold water.


00:33:37.235 --> 00:33:38.536
- Can no one hear her?


00:33:38.569 --> 00:33:41.738
She's ill, she's not well
enough for cold water.


00:33:41.771 --> 00:33:44.842
- Please,
please my head is been hurt.


00:33:44.875 --> 00:33:47.610
My hair is falling out.


00:33:51.779 --> 00:33:53.281
- May I have a nightgown?


00:33:53.314 --> 00:33:55.550
- We have not such things
in this institution.


00:33:55.583 --> 00:33:56.785
- I'm still wet from the bath


00:33:56.818 --> 00:33:58.452
and I shouldn't like
to sleep without one.


00:33:58.485 --> 00:33:59.787
- This is charity


00:33:59.820 --> 00:34:01.689
and you should be
thankful for what you get.


00:34:01.722 --> 00:34:04.390
- But the city pays to
keep these places up


00:34:04.423 --> 00:34:07.494
and pays people to be kind to
the unfortunates brought here.


00:34:07.527 --> 00:34:10.729
- Well you don't need to
expect any kindness here,


00:34:10.762 --> 00:34:13.565
for you won't get it.


00:34:29.444 --> 00:34:31.780
- Brown, get up.


00:34:32.413 --> 00:34:33.348
Drink this.


00:34:33.381 --> 00:34:34.549
- What is it?


00:34:34.582 --> 00:34:36.184
- It's something
to help you sleep.


00:34:36.217 --> 00:34:36.851
- What's in it?


00:34:36.884 --> 00:34:38.652
- It's Laudannum.


00:34:38.685 --> 00:34:40.621
- Is that not an opium mixture?


00:34:40.654 --> 00:34:42.523
- Yes it
will help you sleep.


00:34:42.556 --> 00:34:43.723
- I'm not going to take opium.


00:34:43.756 --> 00:34:45.625
- The doctor has ordered
it, you must take it.


00:34:45.658 --> 00:34:49.128
- I will do nothing of the sort.


00:34:49.661 --> 00:34:50.896
- Hello Miss Brown.


00:34:50.929 --> 00:34:53.532
Refusing your medication?


00:34:53.565 --> 00:34:56.634
- It is opium, I do
not wish to take opium.


00:34:56.667 --> 00:34:58.502
- Nearly all the
patients take it.


00:34:58.535 --> 00:35:00.503
- I'm not going to take it.


00:35:00.536 --> 00:35:03.439
I do not intend to lose my
wits, even for a few hours.


00:35:03.472 --> 00:35:04.607
- If you do not take it,


00:35:04.640 --> 00:35:10.513
I will put it in your
arm with a needle.


00:35:14.782 --> 00:35:15.850
- This smells horrible.


00:35:15.883 --> 00:35:17.784
- I insist you drink
it all the same.


00:35:41.704 --> 00:35:43.406
- I thought
of Robert Bruce,


00:35:43.439 --> 00:35:45.274
the warrior who led
Scotland during the wars


00:35:45.307 --> 00:35:46.775
of independence.


00:35:46.808 --> 00:35:49.678
In his captivity, he found
confidence from a spider


00:35:49.711 --> 00:35:51.479
building her web across
the roof of his cell,


00:35:52.512 --> 00:35:56.817
undeterred by failure.


00:36:05.824 --> 00:36:07.193
- She's quite mad.


00:36:35.649 --> 00:36:38.684
- You may have my bread.


00:36:38.717 --> 00:36:42.855
- Thank you kindly, but
I will ask the nurse.


00:36:42.888 --> 00:36:46.325
- Excuse me may I have
a second piece of bread.


00:36:48.426 --> 00:36:49.527
- You have forgotten
where your home is,


00:36:49.560 --> 00:36:52.863
but you have not
forgotten how to eat.


00:36:52.896 --> 00:36:53.831
- Thank you.


00:37:12.413 --> 00:37:13.647
- Give me that.


00:37:15.048 --> 00:37:15.915
- To have a good mind,


00:37:15.948 --> 00:37:17.484
the stomach must be fed.


00:37:17.517 --> 00:37:19.518
- I cannot eat this stuff.


00:37:21.687 --> 00:37:24.822
- Patients wait
and transfer here,


00:37:24.855 --> 00:37:28.593
such as these, until the
staff can be allocated


00:37:28.626 --> 00:37:32.729
to move them onto
their daily activities.


00:37:32.762 --> 00:37:35.065
- When was Blackwell's
first opened?


00:37:35.098 --> 00:37:38.601
- The facility
was opened in 1839


00:37:38.634 --> 00:37:41.304
and quickly overrun
with patients.


00:37:41.337 --> 00:37:45.840
It has been in continuous
operations since then.


00:37:45.873 --> 00:37:48.909
Blackwell's was designed
by the faint architect,


00:37:48.942 --> 00:37:52.079
Alexander Jackson Davis.


00:37:52.112 --> 00:37:54.847
The facility was
constructed of granite,


00:37:54.880 --> 00:37:58.484
reflecting a feudal
style of architecture,


00:37:58.517 --> 00:38:00.752
with it's more than
large appearance.


00:38:00.785 --> 00:38:04.656
It's stands 600 feet long.


00:38:04.689 --> 00:38:07.825
Wit the proper
funding and guidance,


00:38:07.858 --> 00:38:11.528
Blackwell"s will one
day be a Utopian example


00:38:11.561 --> 00:38:15.665
of the most advanced
treatment of the insane.


00:38:15.698 --> 00:38:17.466
We have worked miracles


00:38:17.499 --> 00:38:20.803
with limited funding
available to us.


00:38:21.804 --> 00:38:25.073
Now you can see why we
need additional funding.


00:38:25.106 --> 00:38:28.709
Gentleman, please come this way.


00:38:32.679 --> 00:38:34.647
The
snow came early,


00:38:34.680 --> 00:38:36.615
many windows in the
hall were broken,


00:38:36.648 --> 00:38:39.385
and the bitter cold
air was unbearable.


00:38:39.417 --> 00:38:40.885
There was no heat.


00:38:40.918 --> 00:38:43.822
The nurses said it was one of
the rules of the institution,


00:38:43.855 --> 00:38:46.757
not to turn the heat
on until October


00:38:46.790 --> 00:38:48.625
and so we would
have to endure it,


00:38:48.658 --> 00:38:51.861
as the steam pipes had not
even been put in order.


00:38:55.498 --> 00:38:57.799
- How did you sleep
after your cold bath?


00:38:57.832 --> 00:38:59.768
- I almost froze


00:38:59.801 --> 00:39:03.804
and then the noise kept
me awake, it's dreadful.


00:39:03.837 --> 00:39:06.574
My nerves were so unstrung
before I came here


00:39:06.607 --> 00:39:10.009
and I fear I shall not be
able to stand the strain.


00:39:10.042 --> 00:39:12.045
- You must keep your spirits up.


00:39:12.078 --> 00:39:14.113
You never know what is to come.


00:39:14.146 --> 00:39:15.814
And if you give up now,


00:39:15.847 --> 00:39:18.484
the good may arrive and
you will not know it.


00:39:18.517 --> 00:39:19.917
- You are right of course.


00:39:19.950 --> 00:39:21.152
- Miss Tillie
Mayard suffered more


00:39:21.185 --> 00:39:23.521
than any of us from the cold.


00:39:23.554 --> 00:39:26.456
I asked the nurses that we
given additional clothing,


00:39:26.489 --> 00:39:27.991
but they told me to shut up.


00:39:28.024 --> 00:39:30.394
That we had as much as
they intended to give us.


00:39:30.427 --> 00:39:32.995
- Matilda I'll tell you
who has taken your money.


00:39:33.028 --> 00:39:35.064
- Who then, who do
you say has my money?


00:39:35.097 --> 00:39:41.837
- Come close and I'll tell you.


00:39:46.206 --> 00:39:47.608
- Who then, who?


00:39:47.641 --> 00:39:49.008
Please tell me so I
can collect my money


00:39:49.041 --> 00:39:50.843
and pay my way
out of this place.


00:39:50.876 --> 00:39:52.412
- It is Nurse Grupe.


00:39:52.445 --> 00:39:54.913
You must go to her and tell
her she is a thieving whore


00:39:54.946 --> 00:39:56.148
and you want your money


00:39:56.181 --> 00:39:58.850
or you will gouge her eyes out.


00:39:58.883 --> 00:40:02.019
Go to her, go, go
now and tell her.


00:40:05.622 --> 00:40:06.423
- Miss Grupe?


00:40:06.456 --> 00:40:08.024
- Yes Matilda?


00:40:08.057 --> 00:40:12.961
- Miss Grady says that
she is a thieving whore.


00:40:18.065 --> 00:40:19.500
- Matilda!


00:40:19.533 --> 00:40:21.770
Come here to me.


00:40:28.907 --> 00:40:32.912
Now return to your radiator.


00:40:32.945 --> 00:40:35.013
The lawyers that
stole your estate


00:40:35.046 --> 00:40:38.550
are in there waiting for
you to give them a piece


00:40:38.583 --> 00:40:40.085
of your mind.


00:41:04.036 --> 00:41:06.940
- I miss my son.


00:41:10.675 --> 00:41:15.713
I miss the way his hair would
smell sweet after a bath.


00:41:15.746 --> 00:41:20.218
I miss the way his
tiny hand wrapped


00:41:20.251 --> 00:41:22.953
around my finger.


00:41:24.521 --> 00:41:26.755
I have
watched patients stand


00:41:26.788 --> 00:41:29.024
and gaze longingly
towards the city bay


00:41:29.057 --> 00:41:31.961
and all likelihood
will never enter again.


00:41:31.994 --> 00:41:35.563
- Miss Fox, get away
from the window.


00:41:35.596 --> 00:41:37.799
There's nothing
out there for you.


00:41:37.832 --> 00:41:39.666
- That I am sure.


00:41:39.699 --> 00:41:41.201
- It means
liberty and life,


00:41:41.234 --> 00:41:43.203
it seems so near


00:41:43.236 --> 00:41:45.671
and yet heaven is not
further from hell.


00:41:45.704 --> 00:41:48.007
- Put out your tongue.


00:41:51.175 --> 00:41:53.912
Hold out your wrists.


00:41:58.282 --> 00:41:59.683
Look at my hand.


00:41:59.716 --> 00:42:01.518
- I have done this
again and again.


00:42:01.551 --> 00:42:04.855
- Look at my hand.


00:42:07.689 --> 00:42:09.558
Stretch out your arms
and work your fingers.


00:42:09.591 --> 00:42:10.692
- Surely by now you
have the results


00:42:10.725 --> 00:42:12.094
of such test
written down some...


00:42:14.128 --> 00:42:17.866
- Now stretch out your
arms and work your fingers.


00:42:21.701 --> 00:42:24.169
- What a
mysterious thing madness is.


00:42:24.202 --> 00:42:26.705
I have watched patients
whose lips are forever sealed


00:42:26.738 --> 00:42:28.974
in a perpetual silence.


00:42:29.007 --> 00:42:32.076
They breathe, eat, the
human form is there,


00:42:32.109 --> 00:42:35.746
but that something which
cannot exist without the body


00:42:35.779 --> 00:42:36.847
is missing.


00:42:36.880 --> 00:42:39.716
- Who sent you here?


00:42:39.749 --> 00:42:41.651
- The doctors.


00:42:41.684 --> 00:42:44.153
- For what?


00:42:44.186 --> 00:42:46.222
- Well they say I am insane.


00:42:47.956 --> 00:42:50.025
- Insane?


00:42:50.058 --> 00:42:52.528
It cannot be seen on your face.


00:42:54.361 --> 00:42:55.763
- Give me that!


00:42:55.796 --> 00:42:57.731
No reading, where
did you get this?


00:42:57.764 --> 00:42:58.965
- I found it.


00:42:58.998 --> 00:43:00.633
- This belongs to the nurses.


00:43:00.666 --> 00:43:03.036
If I catch you touching
the nurses' things again,


00:43:03.069 --> 00:43:06.272
I will send you
to the quiet room.


00:43:09.174 --> 00:43:10.708
- We're not allowed to read?


00:43:10.741 --> 00:43:14.045
- No, nothing that excites
the mind of fervent thinking.


00:43:14.078 --> 00:43:15.613
There are women who
have committed here


00:43:15.646 --> 00:43:17.147
for excessive reading.


00:43:17.180 --> 00:43:18.782
- For reading too much,
that's ridiculous.


00:43:18.815 --> 00:43:21.151
- You're too loud,
they will hear you.


00:43:21.184 --> 00:43:28.189
- Quiet ladies.


00:43:32.193 --> 00:43:33.694
- I
couldn't help but wonder


00:43:33.727 --> 00:43:36.296
about the minds of the nurses.


00:43:36.329 --> 00:43:37.631
What it must have been like


00:43:37.664 --> 00:43:39.165
to constantly fear
loosing control


00:43:39.198 --> 00:43:42.134
over hundreds of
mental patients.


00:43:42.167 --> 00:43:44.170
To fear loosing their position


00:43:44.203 --> 00:43:47.839
and to fear winding up in Blackwells as a patient themselves


00:43:47.872 --> 00:43:49.674
- Nellie Brown.


00:43:49.707 --> 00:43:51.609
- Leona Fox.


00:43:51.642 --> 00:43:53.711
- Why were you
brought to this place?


00:43:53.744 --> 00:43:56.013
- I caught my husband
with our chamber maid.


00:43:56.046 --> 00:43:57.780
Before I could accuse
him of adultery,


00:43:57.813 --> 00:44:01.117
he signed the papers to
have me committed for life.


00:44:05.320 --> 00:44:08.723
- Did you tell the doctors?


00:44:08.756 --> 00:44:11.258
- My accusations are
called delusional,


00:44:11.291 --> 00:44:13.660
proof to them of my
demented fantasies.


00:44:13.693 --> 00:44:16.763
But I saw them with
my own two eyes.


00:44:19.965 --> 00:44:24.036
A woman has no voice when
man signs her way as insane.


00:44:24.069 --> 00:44:27.105
It is only
after one is in trouble,


00:44:27.138 --> 00:44:29.040
that one realizes
how little sympathy


00:44:29.073 --> 00:44:31.875
and kindness there
is in the world.


00:44:50.090 --> 00:44:52.393
- Come out into the hall!


00:44:52.426 --> 00:44:54.227
- It's an invitation to supper.


00:44:54.260 --> 00:44:56.630
- Let's go everybody up,
out in the hall come on.


00:45:55.211 --> 00:45:57.946
- Nellie Brown, come with me.


00:45:57.979 --> 00:45:59.881
- Where am I being taken?


00:45:59.914 --> 00:46:02.350
- A judge is asking
questions about you.


00:46:02.383 --> 00:46:04.785
So you caught the
eye of Dr. Ingram.


00:46:04.818 --> 00:46:07.088
He wishes to speak with you.


00:46:18.864 --> 00:46:20.032
- Do you wish me to
stick out my tongue


00:46:20.065 --> 00:46:22.166
and hold out my hands?


00:46:22.199 --> 00:46:23.735
- No.


00:46:23.768 --> 00:46:26.169
No, that will not be
necessary this time.


00:46:26.202 --> 00:46:28.305
How are you sleeping?


00:46:28.338 --> 00:46:30.741
- How would you
sleep locked in here?


00:46:30.774 --> 00:46:32.441
- I'm here to help you.


00:46:32.474 --> 00:46:33.776
- Help me?


00:46:33.809 --> 00:46:35.277
- Yes, is there
anything bothering you


00:46:35.310 --> 00:46:37.879
that you would
like to talk about?


00:46:37.912 --> 00:46:41.449
- Yes, in case a fire should
break out in the asylum,


00:46:41.482 --> 00:46:43.884
all of the doors are
locked separately


00:46:43.917 --> 00:46:45.285
and the windows
are heavily bared


00:46:45.318 --> 00:46:47.254
so that escape is impossible.


00:46:47.287 --> 00:46:49.089
A fire is not improbable,


00:46:49.122 --> 00:46:50.923
but one of the most
likely occurrences.


00:46:50.956 --> 00:46:52.925
- Your nurses are expected
to open the doors.


00:46:52.958 --> 00:46:54.260
- Should the building burn,


00:46:54.293 --> 00:46:55.927
the jailers or nurses would
never think of releasing


00:46:55.960 --> 00:46:57.462
their crazy patients.


00:46:57.495 --> 00:47:01.932
These women will be
left to roast to death.


00:47:01.965 --> 00:47:03.200
Why don't you have a change?


00:47:03.233 --> 00:47:06.469
- I offer suggestions
until my brain is tired.


00:47:06.502 --> 00:47:08.071
But what would you do,


00:47:08.104 --> 00:47:10.340
a proclaimed insane girl?


00:47:10.373 --> 00:47:13.809
- Well I should insist on
them having locks put in,


00:47:13.842 --> 00:47:15.210
as I have seen in some places


00:47:15.243 --> 00:47:17.813
that by turning a crank
at the end of the hall,


00:47:17.846 --> 00:47:21.783
you can lock or unlock
every door on the one side.


00:47:21.816 --> 00:47:24.818
Then there is some
chance of escape.


00:47:24.851 --> 00:47:26.553
Now every door being
locked separately,


00:47:26.586 --> 00:47:29.055
there is absolutely none.


00:47:29.088 --> 00:47:30.856
- What institution
were you a inmate of


00:47:30.889 --> 00:47:32.925
before you came here?


00:47:35.027 --> 00:47:38.096
- None, I never was
confined to any institution.


00:47:38.129 --> 00:47:41.198
- Well then where did you see
the locks you have described.


00:47:41.231 --> 00:47:45.035
- I've seen them in
places I was in...


00:47:45.068 --> 00:47:47.537
I mean as a visitor.


00:47:47.570 --> 00:47:49.272
- There is only one
place I know of,


00:47:49.305 --> 00:47:51.007
where where they
have those locks.


00:47:51.040 --> 00:47:53.241
And that is at Sin Sing


00:47:53.274 --> 00:47:56.578
and the only ones going through
Sin Sing besides the inmates


00:47:56.611 --> 00:48:00.514
are the guards,
lawyers, and reporters.


00:48:01.715 --> 00:48:06.319
I assure you I had never update
been an inmate of Sin Sing


00:48:06.352 --> 00:48:08.455
or ever even visited.


00:48:18.562 --> 00:48:20.498
-
There were whispers


00:48:20.531 --> 00:48:22.299
that those who attempted
to get word out


00:48:22.332 --> 00:48:24.868
about the conditions
in the asylum,


00:48:24.901 --> 00:48:27.003
disappeared.


00:48:27.036 --> 00:48:29.104
I was increasingly
fearful that my notebook


00:48:29.137 --> 00:48:30.406
would be discovered.


00:48:50.355 --> 00:48:51.824
- Get away from that!


00:49:11.072 --> 00:49:12.474
- Have a look.


00:49:15.376 --> 00:49:18.079
- Exactly as you expected.


00:49:20.613 --> 00:49:25.117
- Urena, what is your age?


00:49:25.150 --> 00:49:28.420
- Why I am fourteen years old.


00:49:28.453 --> 00:49:31.222
- Fourteen years old?


00:49:31.255 --> 00:49:34.893
The doctors say
you are 26, not 14.


00:49:34.926 --> 00:49:37.661
- I am fourteen.


00:49:37.694 --> 00:49:39.196
- The doctors know better,


00:49:39.229 --> 00:49:42.198
they say that you're 26.


00:49:42.231 --> 00:49:44.467
- It is not true.


00:49:44.500 --> 00:49:46.135
I am fourteen years of age.


00:49:46.168 --> 00:49:47.203
You were fourteen


00:49:47.236 --> 00:49:48.937
when the accident happened.


00:49:48.970 --> 00:49:49.671
- What accident?


00:49:49.704 --> 00:49:51.640
What are you talking about?


00:49:53.441 --> 00:49:57.211
- Urena, do you
know where you are?


00:49:57.244 --> 00:50:01.047
- Yes, I am on rig


00:50:01.080 --> 00:50:03.950
at the garment factory.


00:50:03.983 --> 00:50:05.617
- At the garment factory?


00:50:05.650 --> 00:50:08.587
- That is where you
had your accident.


00:50:08.620 --> 00:50:10.389
Fell off the balcony and


00:50:10.422 --> 00:50:12.323
banged you head.


00:50:14.325 --> 00:50:17.594
- It isn't true.


00:50:17.627 --> 00:50:19.930
I'm at the factory
now, I'm on break.


00:50:19.963 --> 00:50:21.431
- It happened 12 years ago


00:50:21.464 --> 00:50:23.399
and that is when you came here.


00:50:23.432 --> 00:50:25.668
- 12 years ago?


00:50:25.701 --> 00:50:28.569
- Yes you fell and became
stuck at the age 14


00:50:28.602 --> 00:50:33.341
and you were sent here to
Blackwell's Women Asylum


00:50:33.374 --> 00:50:34.608
in my care.


00:50:37.577 --> 00:50:39.212
- No.


00:50:39.245 --> 00:50:43.449
It is not true, it is not true.


00:50:49.554 --> 00:50:51.989
Am I not at the factory?


00:50:52.022 --> 00:50:53.991
- No you're not at
the garment factory.


00:50:54.024 --> 00:50:55.526
You're in an insane asylum.


00:50:57.093 --> 00:50:57.727
- No.


00:50:57.760 --> 00:50:59.128
- No.


00:50:59.161 --> 00:51:00.063
- No!


00:51:00.096 --> 00:51:01.164
- No.


00:51:01.197 --> 00:51:02.165
- No!


00:51:02.198 --> 00:51:02.598
- No.


00:51:02.631 --> 00:51:03.332
- No!


00:51:03.365 --> 00:51:03.966
- No.


00:51:03.999 --> 00:51:04.533
- No!


00:51:04.566 --> 00:51:06.201
- No.


00:51:06.234 --> 00:51:08.103
- No it is not true.


00:51:08.136 --> 00:51:09.270
- Oh okay.


00:51:10.304 --> 00:51:11.639
Don't you push me around.


00:51:11.672 --> 00:51:14.541
I'm taking you to
the quiet room.


00:51:14.574 --> 00:51:15.575
Let's go.


00:51:21.546 --> 00:51:24.483
- Blackwell's
had a stench to it.


00:51:24.516 --> 00:51:26.084
Partly from the kitchens


00:51:26.117 --> 00:51:29.520
and partly from the
onsite crematorium.


00:51:29.553 --> 00:51:30.688
It had become clear to me


00:51:30.721 --> 00:51:33.724
that Blackwell's
was dumping ground.


00:51:33.757 --> 00:51:35.459
A place for the
city to rid itself


00:51:35.492 --> 00:51:38.494
of the overflow of the poor.


00:51:38.527 --> 00:51:41.564
Once committed, there
was no way to exit,


00:51:41.597 --> 00:51:44.266
except through the crematorium.


00:51:47.368 --> 00:51:49.169
What'd
you know about her?


00:51:49.202 --> 00:51:50.504
- Not much.


00:51:50.537 --> 00:51:53.774
She's arrogant and
a troublemaker.


00:51:53.807 --> 00:51:56.676
- Is she responding
to treatment?


00:51:56.709 --> 00:51:58.678
- We have her on Laudannum.


00:51:58.711 --> 00:52:01.313
Increase the dosage.


00:52:02.380 --> 00:52:04.249
- Hello Mrs. McGuinness.


00:52:04.282 --> 00:52:07.251
- Hello Miss Brown.


00:52:07.284 --> 00:52:08.719
- Why were you brought here?


00:52:08.752 --> 00:52:10.755
- I was sick.


00:52:10.788 --> 00:52:12.255
- Are you sick mentally?


00:52:12.288 --> 00:52:13.456
- No, no.


00:52:13.489 --> 00:52:17.093
I had been overworking
myself and I broke down.


00:52:17.126 --> 00:52:20.429
Having some family troubles
and being penniless


00:52:20.462 --> 00:52:21.697
and nowhere to go,


00:52:21.730 --> 00:52:23.132
I applied to the Commissioner's


00:52:23.165 --> 00:52:24.332
to be sent to the poor house


00:52:24.365 --> 00:52:27.268
until I would be
able to work again.


00:52:27.301 --> 00:52:29.037
- But they do not
send poor people here,


00:52:29.070 --> 00:52:31.471
unless they are insane?


00:52:31.504 --> 00:52:33.407
Don't you know there
are only insane women


00:52:33.440 --> 00:52:36.075
or those supposed
to be so sent here?


00:52:36.108 --> 00:52:38.744
- There are 1600 women
on Blackwell's Island,


00:52:38.777 --> 00:52:40.146
I knew when I got here


00:52:40.179 --> 00:52:42.180
that the majority of
these women were insane,


00:52:42.213 --> 00:52:44.482
but then I believed
them when they told me


00:52:44.515 --> 00:52:47.217
that this is the place
where they send all the poor


00:52:47.250 --> 00:52:49.153
who had applied for
aid, as I had done.


00:52:49.186 --> 00:52:51.121
- Really, I'm going to kill you.


00:52:51.154 --> 00:52:52.455
I'm going to kill you!


00:52:52.488 --> 00:52:54.257
- Who are they?


00:52:54.290 --> 00:52:56.459
- They're the women of the rope.


00:52:56.492 --> 00:52:58.093
They're considered to be
the most violent women


00:52:58.126 --> 00:52:59.728
on the island.


00:52:59.761 --> 00:53:01.363
The live in the lodge.


00:53:01.629 --> 00:53:04.398
I, myself, share
the fear that everyone felt,


00:53:04.431 --> 00:53:07.768
the possibility of being
sent to the violent ward.


00:53:07.801 --> 00:53:10.737
The mortality rate
there was high.


00:53:19.244 --> 00:53:20.746
One day a woman was brought in


00:53:20.779 --> 00:53:23.181
who had a fear of being touched


00:53:23.214 --> 00:53:27.518
and an extreme fear
of uncleanliness.


00:53:31.488 --> 00:53:32.755
- Sit down where
we get you set up,


00:53:32.788 --> 00:53:41.797
with a room and proper gown.


00:53:46.299 --> 00:53:48.202
- I'm Nellie Brown.


00:53:48.235 --> 00:53:49.470
- Margaret.


00:53:49.503 --> 00:53:54.541
- Tillie Mayard.


00:53:58.910 --> 00:53:59.878
- Put this on.


00:53:59.911 --> 00:54:01.445
- What here?


00:54:01.478 --> 00:54:03.781
- You left modesty
in the outside world.


00:54:03.814 --> 00:54:06.684
In Blackwell's we
have nothing to hide.


00:54:06.717 --> 00:54:09.285
- No I will not, it
is not dignified.


00:54:09.318 --> 00:54:12.222
That rag is soiled, I will
not put that dirty thing...


00:54:12.255 --> 00:54:13.822
No, no!


00:54:13.855 --> 00:54:15.324
Stop it no!


00:54:15.357 --> 00:54:17.326
Get your hands off me!


00:54:22.696 --> 00:54:27.534
No please.


00:54:31.803 --> 00:54:35.374
Please stop it, stop it.


00:54:35.407 --> 00:54:36.774
No.


00:54:53.454 --> 00:54:56.592
- I'll kill the devils
between my life.


00:55:00.561 --> 00:55:01.896
Poor
Matilda had finally


00:55:01.929 --> 00:55:04.398
avenged the attorneys
who stole her estate.


00:55:04.431 --> 00:55:05.665
- Take her to the retreat.


00:55:05.698 --> 00:55:06.799
- By
plunging the cook's knife


00:55:06.832 --> 00:55:08.868
into the heart of
one of the nurses.


00:55:08.901 --> 00:55:12.738
She was immediately sent to the
violent ward in the retreat.


00:55:16.840 --> 00:55:20.311
Is
it Nellie Brown.


00:55:22.745 --> 00:55:24.548
- Louise?


00:55:25.949 --> 00:55:27.684
Louise Schanz?


00:55:30.752 --> 00:55:32.188
Yes it's me.


00:55:32.221 --> 00:55:35.490
It's so cold.


00:55:38.693 --> 00:55:42.696
God, let me die.


00:56:23.296 --> 00:56:25.898
- Let me go.


00:56:35.773 --> 00:56:38.976
- Get your hands off me.


00:56:39.009 --> 00:56:42.012
Stop, stop!


00:56:42.045 --> 00:56:44.747
Let go of me.


00:57:01.027 --> 00:57:03.363
- They held
Margaret naked in the cold bath


00:57:03.396 --> 00:57:04.798
all through the night.


00:57:06.398 --> 00:57:08.734
- Help me carry her to her room.


00:57:34.721 --> 00:57:35.856
They inject into


00:57:35.889 --> 00:57:38.759
or force so much
opium on the patients,


00:57:38.792 --> 00:57:41.794
that the patients
are made crazy.


00:57:41.827 --> 00:57:43.729
A sure way to lose one's mind


00:57:43.762 --> 00:57:47.899
into the walls of
Blackwell's forever.


00:58:15.788 --> 00:58:18.792
- Everybody up bath
time, single file!


00:58:18.825 --> 00:58:21.427
- Do not take a
bath in that water.


00:58:21.460 --> 00:58:23.028
The very disease for
which I am suffering,


00:58:23.061 --> 00:58:24.963
and for which I need
doctoring makes it necessary


00:58:24.996 --> 00:58:27.098
that I should not
bathe in cold water.


00:58:27.131 --> 00:58:28.800
I do not want to
go into that water.


00:58:28.833 --> 00:58:31.102
It is filthy and filled
with human excrement


00:58:31.135 --> 00:58:34.605
and the burst eruptions
of sick patients' skin.


00:58:47.849 --> 00:58:49.717
- She's dead.


00:58:49.750 --> 00:58:51.618
How was she last night?


00:58:51.651 --> 00:58:53.887
These bruises on her cheeks,


00:58:53.920 --> 00:58:57.423
it looks as if she
was in a fight.


00:58:57.456 --> 00:59:00.727
- She was agitated doctor.


00:59:00.760 --> 00:59:02.828
- I see.


00:59:02.861 --> 00:59:06.532
Obviously she died
of convulsion.


00:59:09.733 --> 00:59:12.636
I'll make out the
death certificate.


00:59:14.771 --> 00:59:16.139
I'm finished here.


00:59:16.172 --> 00:59:17.607
-
Margaret was cremated


00:59:17.640 --> 00:59:21.009
and put into lead tin
with only a number,


00:59:21.042 --> 00:59:23.612
like many hundreds before her.


00:59:55.070 --> 00:59:59.174
- Don't stop Miss
Brown, play another.


00:59:59.207 --> 01:00:01.576
- I never learned to dance.


01:00:01.609 --> 01:00:03.745
- It isn't that difficult.


01:00:03.778 --> 01:00:04.812
- I said no.


01:00:36.572 --> 01:00:38.808
- I can play no more.


01:00:38.841 --> 01:00:40.575
My hands have stoke up.


01:00:40.608 --> 01:00:41.743
- No matter,


01:00:41.776 --> 01:00:44.045
when one has music
in one's spirit.


01:00:59.123 --> 01:01:00.859
- No.


01:01:42.226 --> 01:01:44.829
- I want to go home.


01:02:20.124 --> 01:02:22.159
- How are you doing?


01:02:22.192 --> 01:02:23.760
I'm super intendant.


01:02:23.793 --> 01:02:27.063
Anne how are you today?


01:02:28.730 --> 01:02:30.199
- Stay back.


01:02:33.001 --> 01:02:34.036
She has a fever.


01:02:34.069 --> 01:02:35.303
What is this patient's name?


01:02:35.336 --> 01:02:37.605
- Her name is Louise Schanz.


01:02:37.638 --> 01:02:38.773
She doesn't belong here


01:02:38.806 --> 01:02:41.208
they took her baby away
at Belview Hospital.


01:02:44.344 --> 01:02:46.212
- Louise?


01:02:46.245 --> 01:02:47.713
- She is suffering from the cold


01:02:47.746 --> 01:02:49.048
and insufficient clothing.


01:02:49.081 --> 01:02:51.050
- The nurses will beat you.


01:02:51.083 --> 01:02:52.084
- Take her away.


01:03:09.164 --> 01:03:13.302
So what do you know
of Louise Schanz


01:03:13.335 --> 01:03:15.903
and why do you care?


01:03:15.936 --> 01:03:17.605
- I know that she is sane


01:03:17.638 --> 01:03:19.840
and does not belong
in this place.


01:03:19.873 --> 01:03:21.174
I know that her English is poor


01:03:21.207 --> 01:03:23.777
and she has no way to speak
her case to any justice.


01:03:23.810 --> 01:03:25.745
- I see


01:03:25.778 --> 01:03:29.915
and how did you get here?


01:03:29.948 --> 01:03:33.351
- I was committed as an
insane woman in this asylum.


01:03:33.384 --> 01:03:34.986
I am here without
hope of release.


01:03:35.019 --> 01:03:36.721
- And you think you are insane?


01:03:36.754 --> 01:03:37.955
- No I am not insane.


01:03:37.988 --> 01:03:41.625
- Of course,
everybody says that.


01:03:41.658 --> 01:03:43.093
- So you think,


01:03:43.126 --> 01:03:45.995
Mrs. Schanz is being persecuted?


01:03:47.630 --> 01:03:48.931
- No not persecuted but...


01:03:48.964 --> 01:03:51.700
- You said she's
wrongfully committed here.


01:03:51.733 --> 01:03:52.667
- Yes but...


01:03:52.700 --> 01:03:54.369
- So you are not insane,


01:03:54.402 --> 01:03:56.737
Mrs. Schanz is not insane.


01:03:56.770 --> 01:04:00.274
Is everyone wrongfully
committed here as well?


01:04:03.275 --> 01:04:05.044
- I can see that these
patients need help.


01:04:05.077 --> 01:04:07.179
- And you Florence Nightingale


01:04:07.212 --> 01:04:09.181
are going to help them all.


01:04:09.214 --> 01:04:10.749
Is that it?


01:04:12.883 --> 01:04:16.988
Delusions such as these can
be cured with medication.


01:04:17.021 --> 01:04:19.623
- They force me to drink
the medication every night,


01:04:19.656 --> 01:04:20.857
it's not right.


01:04:20.890 --> 01:04:23.259
- No we're giving you
the wrong medication.


01:04:23.292 --> 01:04:26.261
I don't recall seeing
a medical degree


01:04:26.294 --> 01:04:28.330
on your admission papers.


01:04:28.363 --> 01:04:30.165
Did I miss something?


01:04:34.168 --> 01:04:37.070
You really must
trust me Miss Brown.


01:04:37.103 --> 01:04:40.307
We are the doctors
here, not you.


01:04:40.340 --> 01:04:44.810
I am a doctor and I want
the best for my patients.


01:04:44.843 --> 01:04:46.312
I truly do.


01:04:49.947 --> 01:04:54.218
Tell Dr. Kinier to increase
Miss Brown's nightly dose


01:04:54.251 --> 01:04:58.688
of Laudannum to 150
parts per thousand.


01:04:58.721 --> 01:05:00.390
- Yes Doctor.


01:05:00.423 --> 01:05:02.925
- That should put
your mind at rest.


01:05:02.958 --> 01:05:06.695
You see, I'm just
trying the best I can.


01:05:09.297 --> 01:05:11.199
Have a good day.


01:05:15.402 --> 01:05:17.304
- Go on, mind your business.


01:05:29.814 --> 01:05:31.315
- I want my book and pencil.


01:05:31.348 --> 01:05:33.316
It helps me remember things.


01:05:33.349 --> 01:05:35.719
- You can't have it, so shut up.


01:05:35.752 --> 01:05:39.389
- Give it back or I shall
have to tell Dr. Ingram.


01:05:41.790 --> 01:05:43.059
- You had no book or pencil.


01:05:43.092 --> 01:05:45.060
- I just watched you
place it in your apron.


01:05:45.093 --> 01:05:47.729
- I advise you to fight
against the imaginations


01:05:47.762 --> 01:05:48.964
of your brain.


01:06:00.106 --> 01:06:03.375
- Benny, is that
my husband Benny?


01:06:03.408 --> 01:06:04.843
- I'm sure your mistaken.


01:06:04.876 --> 01:06:06.178
- It's Benny.


01:06:06.211 --> 01:06:07.778
Benny my husband, he's come
to take me out of here.


01:06:07.811 --> 01:06:09.880
- Stop it, that is
not your husband.


01:06:09.913 --> 01:06:11.348
- It's Benny, he's
come to free me.


01:06:11.381 --> 01:06:13.116
- Benny I'm here.
- No dear.


01:06:13.149 --> 01:06:15.385
- Benny, Benny.
- Give up alright.


01:06:15.418 --> 01:06:17.254
He's come to free me Benny.


01:06:19.187 --> 01:06:20.355
- Just leave her alone.


01:06:20.388 --> 01:06:21.957
- Benny take me out of here.


01:06:21.990 --> 01:06:23.358
- Leave her alone.


01:06:23.391 --> 01:06:24.259
- Let's go.


01:06:24.292 --> 01:06:26.161
- Stop!


01:06:33.399 --> 01:06:37.236
- Inmates running the asylum...


01:06:37.269 --> 01:06:39.872
I don't think so.


01:06:44.041 --> 01:06:47.845
You have brought this
particular lesson on yourself.


01:07:01.956 --> 01:07:03.291
Miss Grupe?


01:07:03.324 --> 01:07:05.426
Yes Doctor?


01:07:05.459 --> 01:07:09.330
- What happened to this patient?


01:07:09.363 --> 01:07:11.998
- She was trying
to escape doctor.


01:07:12.031 --> 01:07:14.234
She had the delusions
that her husband is coming


01:07:14.267 --> 01:07:17.202
to take her out of Blackwell's.


01:07:17.235 --> 01:07:20.539
- How did she get
those black eyes?


01:07:20.572 --> 01:07:24.408
- She had the bruises
when she was brought in.


01:07:24.441 --> 01:07:28.512
- Now, they look fresh to me.


01:07:28.545 --> 01:07:33.383
Are you sure she had
it when she came in?


01:07:33.416 --> 01:07:37.153
- I will have a good
talking with the orderlies.


01:07:37.186 --> 01:07:38.755
Get to the bottom of this.


01:07:40.588 --> 01:07:43.458
- Make sure you do that.


01:07:43.491 --> 01:07:47.828
This is not a prison Miss Grupe.


01:07:47.861 --> 01:07:49.797
It's a medical facility,


01:07:49.830 --> 01:07:52.131
where we're trying
to help people,


01:07:52.164 --> 01:07:54.300
to give them a better life.


01:07:54.333 --> 01:07:55.902
Is that clear Miss Grupe?


01:07:55.935 --> 01:07:57.435
- Yes Doctor.


01:07:57.468 --> 01:07:59.004
As it turned out,


01:07:59.037 --> 01:08:01.573
Mrs. Cotter wasn't delusional.


01:08:01.606 --> 01:08:03.541
Her husband Benny had
actually been doing everything


01:08:03.574 --> 01:08:06.277
in his power to take
her out of Blackwell's,


01:08:06.310 --> 01:08:09.212
but was caught in bureaucracy.


01:08:10.279 --> 01:08:12.983
Eventually he trialed
and won her release.


01:08:59.187 --> 01:09:01.522
- What is it now Miss Grupe?


01:09:01.555 --> 01:09:05.025
- One of the nurses took
this from the patient,


01:09:05.058 --> 01:09:06.492
Nellie Brown.


01:09:06.525 --> 01:09:09.429
- Let me have it.


01:09:13.899 --> 01:09:15.234
Has anyone seen this?


01:09:15.267 --> 01:09:17.236
- No Doctor.


01:09:17.269 --> 01:09:21.372
- It's very organized and
articulate for a mental patient.


01:09:22.206 --> 01:09:23.573
- There is something
else Doctor.


01:09:23.606 --> 01:09:25.141
- Well?


01:09:25.174 --> 01:09:28.445
- A reporter is here asking
to speak with Nellie Brown.


01:09:28.478 --> 01:09:31.480
- A reporter?


01:09:35.283 --> 01:09:40.055
It is the fault of that meddling
judge who sent her here.


01:09:44.057 --> 01:09:46.392
We can't deny them
access to her.


01:09:46.425 --> 01:09:49.528
That would only create
a sensational story.


01:09:49.561 --> 01:09:51.664
Let him meet with her.


01:09:51.697 --> 01:09:54.466
But make sure they're
never out of close sight


01:09:54.499 --> 01:09:56.001
of the nursing staff.


01:09:56.034 --> 01:09:57.168
- Yes Doctor.


01:09:57.201 --> 01:10:00.004
- And if she says
anything, anything


01:10:00.037 --> 01:10:03.307
that could be harmful
to this institution,


01:10:03.340 --> 01:10:04.908
see that she's cut off.


01:10:08.144 --> 01:10:10.246
- Here put that on quickly.


01:10:22.255 --> 01:10:23.523
- If you make it a
practice of telling,


01:10:23.556 --> 01:10:25.191
it will be a serious
thing for you.


01:10:25.224 --> 01:10:26.559
To my surprise,


01:10:26.591 --> 01:10:28.060
I was brought face-to-face
with the first reporter


01:10:28.093 --> 01:10:29.428
I had ever worked alongside


01:10:29.461 --> 01:10:30.996
at the Pittsburgh Dispatch.


01:10:31.029 --> 01:10:32.430
- I do not know this man.


01:10:32.463 --> 01:10:34.032
- Do you know her?


01:10:34.065 --> 01:10:35.700
- No this is not the young
lady, I came in search of.


01:10:35.733 --> 01:10:38.435
I was mistaken, I thought
she was somebody else,


01:10:38.468 --> 01:10:41.271
somebody I knew a long time ago.


01:10:41.304 --> 01:10:44.240
- If you do not know her,
you cannot stay here.


01:10:45.174 --> 01:10:47.009
- One moment Señor...


01:10:47.042 --> 01:10:48.978
Do you speak Spanish, Señor?


01:10:49.011 --> 01:10:50.211
- No...


01:10:50.244 --> 01:10:51.579
What in places are
you doing in here?


01:10:51.612 --> 01:10:55.649
- It's alright, I'm after
an item, keep still.


01:10:55.682 --> 01:10:59.119
- No I'm afraid I do not
speak a word of Spanish.


01:10:59.152 --> 01:11:00.521
It was
Wilson, who's article


01:11:00.554 --> 01:11:02.188
I had anonymously responded to,


01:11:02.221 --> 01:11:05.158
that launched my
career as a reporter.


01:11:26.274 --> 01:11:27.242
- Come with me.


01:11:27.275 --> 01:11:29.511
- Please.


01:11:29.544 --> 01:11:32.747
Please I'm so cold,
I can't stay here.


01:11:32.780 --> 01:11:34.549
- Where are you taking her?


01:11:34.582 --> 01:11:40.454
- She needs help.


01:11:44.356 --> 01:11:46.258
- Anne Neville was one
of the quietest women


01:11:46.291 --> 01:11:47.759
in the institution.


01:11:47.792 --> 01:11:50.128
To protect herself
and her sanity,


01:11:50.161 --> 01:11:53.530
she did everything she was
told without complaint.


01:11:53.563 --> 01:11:55.232
I admired her strength


01:11:55.265 --> 01:11:58.168
and determination of will.


01:11:58.201 --> 01:12:02.171
♪ Mid pleasures


01:12:02.204 --> 01:12:05.707
♪ And palaces


01:12:05.740 --> 01:12:10.478
♪ Though we may roam


01:12:11.545 --> 01:12:15.182
♪ Be it ever


01:12:15.215 --> 01:12:18.385
♪ So humble


01:12:18.418 --> 01:12:20.487
♪ There's no


01:12:20.520 --> 01:12:25.290
♪ Place like home


01:12:25.323 --> 01:12:28.760
♪ A charm from


01:12:28.793 --> 01:12:31.496
♪ The sky


01:12:31.529 --> 01:12:36.533
♪ Seems to hallow us here


01:12:39.201 --> 01:12:44.073
♪ Which seek through the world


01:12:44.473 --> 01:12:49.478
♪ Is ne'er met with elsewhere


01:12:52.846 --> 01:12:58.051
♪ Home, home


01:12:58.217 --> 01:13:01.587
♪ Sweet, sweet


01:13:01.620 --> 01:13:03.789
♪ Home


01:13:03.822 --> 01:13:07.492
♪ There's no place


01:13:07.525 --> 01:13:09.493
♪ Like home ♪


01:13:09.526 --> 01:13:11.429
- Get away from here.


01:13:25.773 --> 01:13:28.510
- Everybody up, bath
time single file!


01:13:37.316 --> 01:13:39.852
- I don't think I'm
going to survive today.


01:13:39.885 --> 01:13:43.055
- Don't fight them, they'll
move you through faster.


01:13:52.462 --> 01:13:54.297
As much
as I hated the baths,


01:13:54.330 --> 01:13:55.465
I would have taken another


01:13:55.498 --> 01:14:00.269
if it could've saved
Tillie from hers.


01:14:04.172 --> 01:14:06.173
My heart ached to
see Tille Mayard go


01:14:06.206 --> 01:14:07.575
from recovered from her sickness


01:14:07.608 --> 01:14:09.643
when she had been
brought to Blackwell's,


01:14:09.676 --> 01:14:13.513
to growing ever sicker
as they days wore on.


01:14:13.546 --> 01:14:16.583
Tillie had changed so
much for the worse,


01:14:16.616 --> 01:14:19.418
that I was mortified
when I looked at her.


01:14:29.325 --> 01:14:31.695
- You must keep your spirits up.


01:14:44.338 --> 01:14:47.307
- It is cruel to lock people
up and then freeze them.


01:14:47.340 --> 01:14:49.710
- She has as much
has any of the rest,


01:14:49.743 --> 01:14:50.878
she'll get no more.


01:15:00.685 --> 01:15:01.920
- Let her fall on the floor


01:15:01.953 --> 01:15:03.420
and this will
teach her a lesson.


01:15:04.855 --> 01:15:06.323
- You are cruel to
treat her this way,


01:15:06.356 --> 01:15:08.459
can't you see she is
suffering and in need of care.


01:15:08.492 --> 01:15:10.760
- She needs medical help.


01:15:20.568 --> 01:15:23.571
- You must send help for a
patient, Miss Tille Mayard.


01:15:23.604 --> 01:15:24.906
She is having a
fit from the cold


01:15:24.939 --> 01:15:26.840
and the nurses are not
sending for a doctor.


01:15:26.873 --> 01:15:28.441
They're doing
nothing to help her.


01:15:28.474 --> 01:15:30.443
- Please calm
yourself Miss Brown.


01:15:30.476 --> 01:15:32.745
- See that Dr. Kinier is
dispatched to Miss Tillie Mayard


01:15:32.778 --> 01:15:34.947
at once.


01:15:34.980 --> 01:15:37.383
There see, she will be helped.


01:15:37.416 --> 01:15:39.284
Now please, calm yourself.


01:15:39.317 --> 01:15:40.351
- I will not.


01:15:40.384 --> 01:15:41.586
The cold is so bad,


01:15:41.619 --> 01:15:43.587
it sent Miss Mayard into a fit.


01:15:43.620 --> 01:15:46.356
I fear she will not survive.


01:15:46.389 --> 01:15:52.729
- I will see to
these things at once.


01:15:57.398 --> 01:15:58.500
- Why?


01:15:58.533 --> 01:16:01.202
Why am I being given
special treatment?


01:16:01.235 --> 01:16:04.271
Why is the Assistant
Superintendent so interested


01:16:04.304 --> 01:16:05.839
in my case, in particular?


01:16:05.872 --> 01:16:08.441
- We care about the
treatment of all patients


01:16:08.474 --> 01:16:10.911
at Blackwell's Insane Asylum.


01:16:14.246 --> 01:16:17.316
And a Judge Duffy has
been sending reporters


01:16:17.349 --> 01:16:19.517
to ask about you.


01:16:21.285 --> 01:16:24.221
Tell me, do you
think you are insane?


01:16:26.356 --> 01:16:27.657
- Yes insane.


01:16:27.690 --> 01:16:30.626
I have watched insanity
slowly creeping over minds


01:16:30.659 --> 01:16:32.528
that had appeared to be alright.


01:16:32.561 --> 01:16:36.331
I curse all doctors, nurses,
and public institutions


01:16:36.364 --> 01:16:37.532
for their treatment of people


01:16:37.565 --> 01:16:39.768
that have no advocacy.


01:16:43.503 --> 01:16:47.340
- I will order Miss Grady
to see that more clothing


01:16:47.373 --> 01:16:50.543
is given to the patients.


01:17:10.992 --> 01:17:13.328
- Hand it over,
you know the rules.


01:17:13.361 --> 01:17:14.596
No reading.


01:17:14.629 --> 01:17:15.830
- It is only a book of psalms.


01:17:15.863 --> 01:17:17.765
- Reading agitates the mind.


01:17:17.798 --> 01:17:19.667
- How can book of psalms
be bad for the mind?


01:17:19.700 --> 01:17:21.735
- Hand me the book.


01:17:26.306 --> 01:17:32.678
Hand it over.


01:17:36.847 --> 01:17:38.816
You did this to yourself.


01:17:41.785 --> 01:17:43.387
Take her to the quiet room.


01:17:43.420 --> 01:17:48.858
- You're not human.


01:18:02.601 --> 01:18:03.803
- Brown go to the kitchen,


01:18:03.836 --> 01:18:06.006
get a meal and take it
to Mrs. Schanz's room.


01:18:07.639 --> 01:18:08.640
At the
kitchen I was greeted


01:18:08.673 --> 01:18:10.709
with a spread of fresh fruits,


01:18:10.742 --> 01:18:13.444
marveled meats,
and fine cheeses.


01:18:13.477 --> 01:18:15.446
Food, the likes of
which was never shared


01:18:15.479 --> 01:18:17.748
with the patients.


01:18:17.781 --> 01:18:19.582
- Mrs. Schanz is
ill, what about that?


01:18:19.615 --> 01:18:23.320
- That's for the doctor.


01:18:36.830 --> 01:18:39.733
- 150 degrees, I think.


01:18:42.901 --> 01:18:45.638
- How high as your
temperature ever run?


01:18:45.671 --> 01:18:48.740
- Perhaps 101 degrees.


01:18:48.773 --> 01:18:51.877
- It's 99 degrees.


01:18:56.046 --> 01:18:58.515
- I brought you some food.


01:18:58.548 --> 01:18:59.549
- I do not want it.


01:18:59.582 --> 01:19:01.751
- I know how you feel,


01:19:01.784 --> 01:19:04.821
but you need your strength.


01:19:04.854 --> 01:19:06.088
Did they hit you?


01:19:06.121 --> 01:19:09.658
- I have gotten beatings
from Miss Grupe.


01:19:10.991 --> 01:19:14.628
I am so cold.


01:19:14.661 --> 01:19:19.366
I will never see my son again.


01:19:20.733 --> 01:19:23.402
If only I could die.


01:19:29.006 --> 01:19:32.544
Nein, nein, nein.


01:19:34.010 --> 01:19:35.546
Please.


01:19:36.913 --> 01:19:38.782
No, please there's
nothing wrong with me.


01:19:38.815 --> 01:19:40.783
- Now, now, dear Mrs. Schanz.


01:19:40.816 --> 01:19:43.786
We're here to help you.


01:19:43.819 --> 01:19:44.920
Hold her down.


01:19:44.953 --> 01:19:47.655
- No, please.


01:19:47.688 --> 01:19:48.490
- She doesn't need an injection,


01:19:48.523 --> 01:19:49.791
she just needs rest.


01:19:49.824 --> 01:19:50.892
Do not inject her,


01:19:50.925 --> 01:19:53.127
she only had a
mild coughing fit.


01:19:53.160 --> 01:19:54.461
Do not inject her.


01:19:54.494 --> 01:19:56.964
- Miss Brown enough!


01:20:00.065 --> 01:20:02.435
- There, there.


01:20:06.738 --> 01:20:09.073
Isn't that better?


01:20:12.109 --> 01:20:17.114
- Franklin, you've
grown so much.


01:20:18.881 --> 01:20:21.117
Come dance with me.


01:20:48.972 --> 01:20:51.708
- You have killed her.


01:20:51.741 --> 01:20:52.976
You have killed her.


01:20:53.009 --> 01:20:54.677
- Take Miss Brown
back to her room.


01:20:54.710 --> 01:20:57.213
Send Mrs. Schanz
to the crematorium.


01:20:57.246 --> 01:20:59.215
I will make out the papers.


01:20:59.248 --> 01:21:01.483
- You are a cruel
and inhumane man.


01:21:01.516 --> 01:21:04.986
- Why are you fighting
this so much, Miss Brown?


01:21:05.019 --> 01:21:08.656
I'm trying to bring
these people some relief.


01:21:08.689 --> 01:21:10.624
- By killing them?


01:21:10.657 --> 01:21:12.993
- It was not the intention.


01:21:31.941 --> 01:21:34.678
- You have brought
this up on yourself.


01:21:53.025 --> 01:21:54.828
- Get off the grass!


01:21:59.264 --> 01:22:02.968
- Tillie.


01:22:03.001 --> 01:22:04.802
Tillie?


01:22:04.835 --> 01:22:07.972
- I dreamed of my
mother last night.


01:22:08.005 --> 01:22:14.144
I think she may come
today and take me home.


01:22:18.747 --> 01:22:20.682
I'm cold.


01:22:20.715 --> 01:22:23.518
No don't touch me!


01:22:23.551 --> 01:22:25.720
- I'm trying to warm you.


01:22:28.555 --> 01:22:33.025
- You, you are a traitor.


01:22:33.058 --> 01:22:35.227
There doing this to
me because of you.


01:22:35.260 --> 01:22:36.829
- What?


01:22:36.862 --> 01:22:39.864
- You're trying to pass
yourself off as me.


01:22:39.897 --> 01:22:41.032
- Tillie what do you mean?


01:22:41.065 --> 01:22:43.768
- The reporters and the doctors


01:22:43.801 --> 01:22:46.303
that have come calling
to see Nellie Brown


01:22:46.336 --> 01:22:49.039
are friends in search of me.


01:22:49.072 --> 01:22:51.741
But you are, by some means,


01:22:51.774 --> 01:22:55.644
trying to deceive
them that you are me.


01:22:55.677 --> 01:22:57.145
- No Tillie, I am your friend.


01:22:57.178 --> 01:23:00.015
- You are not my friend!


01:23:01.949 --> 01:23:05.620
- I am here because of you.


01:23:10.022 --> 01:23:11.124
- Tillie,


01:23:11.157 --> 01:23:12.991
what have they
been doing to you?


01:23:13.024 --> 01:23:14.159
They've been injecting
you with opium.


01:23:14.192 --> 01:23:17.129
- It's your fault.


01:23:17.162 --> 01:23:19.664
You trick me into singing,


01:23:19.697 --> 01:23:22.934
so you can steal my voice.


01:23:22.967 --> 01:23:24.668
- No.


01:23:26.636 --> 01:23:31.140
- I can't stay in this
place another day.


01:23:35.177 --> 01:23:36.911
- Tillie shut up


01:23:36.944 --> 01:23:38.580
or I will help you to shut up.


01:23:38.613 --> 01:23:40.014
- Tillie.


01:23:40.047 --> 01:23:41.550
- Get away from me.


01:23:51.323 --> 01:23:53.658
- There are 16
doctors on this island


01:23:53.691 --> 01:23:55.060
and excepting two,


01:23:55.093 --> 01:23:57.596
I have never seen them pay
any attention to the patients.


01:23:57.629 --> 01:24:00.798
How can a doctor judge
a woman's sanity,


01:24:00.831 --> 01:24:02.833
merely by bidding
her good morning


01:24:02.866 --> 01:24:05.902
and refusing to hear
her pleas for release?


01:24:07.336 --> 01:24:10.772
You have no right to
keep sane people here.


01:24:10.805 --> 01:24:12.774
I am sane, have always been so


01:24:12.807 --> 01:24:15.010
and I must insist on
a thorough examination


01:24:15.043 --> 01:24:16.911
or be released.


01:24:16.944 --> 01:24:19.180
Several of the women
here are also sane.


01:24:19.213 --> 01:24:20.781
Why can't they be free?


01:24:20.814 --> 01:24:23.917
- They are insane


01:24:23.950 --> 01:24:27.321
and suffering from delusions.


01:24:28.120 --> 01:24:29.688
- You are such a damn whore,


01:24:29.721 --> 01:24:31.924
it's a good thing for you
that you are being transferred


01:24:31.957 --> 01:24:34.158
or I will make you pay
so well for remembering


01:24:34.191 --> 01:24:37.061
to tell Dr. Ingram everything.


01:24:37.094 --> 01:24:38.997
You forget everything
about yourself,


01:24:39.030 --> 01:24:42.166
but you never forget
anything to tell the Doctor.


01:24:56.710 --> 01:24:58.312
- Not sure I'll be able
to sleep with Matilda


01:24:58.345 --> 01:24:59.980
up creeping about.


01:25:00.013 --> 01:25:03.216
- She's probably out searching
for somebody she want to kill


01:25:03.249 --> 01:25:06.252
- Someone down there.


01:25:07.887 --> 01:25:09.955
- I heard the nurses
talking about you.


01:25:09.988 --> 01:25:11.223
- What did they say?


01:25:11.256 --> 01:25:13.291
- You were to be shut
off from all visitors,


01:25:13.324 --> 01:25:17.695
because you talk too
much out of turn.


01:25:17.728 --> 01:25:19.130
- That's why we were
sent to the violent ward


01:25:19.163 --> 01:25:20.730
to get rid of us.


01:25:20.763 --> 01:25:22.699
I puzzled over
why they sent Anne Neville


01:25:22.732 --> 01:25:24.367
to the violent ward with me.


01:25:24.400 --> 01:25:26.802
I determined that it was
the strength of her spirit,


01:25:26.835 --> 01:25:29.038
her unwillingness to let
the nurses break her will


01:25:29.071 --> 01:25:31.205
that had them focused on her.


01:25:31.238 --> 01:25:33.441
So they sent Anne,
the strongest,


01:25:33.474 --> 01:25:37.411
and me, the loudest, to the
violent ward to finish us.


01:25:54.758 --> 01:25:55.993
- Why was I put in here?


01:25:56.026 --> 01:25:56.761
- Shut up.


01:26:07.802 --> 01:26:10.939
- I understand you been
having continuing trouble


01:26:10.972 --> 01:26:15.076
with fever thinking
and hallucinations.


01:26:15.109 --> 01:26:17.911
- I've had nothing of the sort.


01:26:17.944 --> 01:26:20.013
I'm as sane as anyone.


01:26:20.046 --> 01:26:23.716
- You've demonstrated
delusions of persecution,


01:26:23.749 --> 01:26:27.953
thinking that the orderlies
and nurses are against you,


01:26:27.986 --> 01:26:31.289
that they wish to cause you
harm, instead of help you.


01:26:31.322 --> 01:26:35.225
And that we, your
doctors are murderers.


01:26:35.258 --> 01:26:37.160
- The things I have seen,


01:26:37.193 --> 01:26:39.763
the things I have
told to Dr. Ingram,


01:26:39.796 --> 01:26:40.930
all of them are true.


01:26:40.963 --> 01:26:43.499
- There are many truths
here at Blackwell's.


01:26:43.532 --> 01:26:47.969
It is after all, an
asylum for the insane.


01:26:51.105 --> 01:26:54.041
- I do not need an injection,


01:26:54.074 --> 01:26:55.843
I am perfectly sane.


01:26:55.876 --> 01:26:59.312
- Nearly all the patients
here deny their insanity.


01:26:59.345 --> 01:27:01.814
- Besides you nightly medicate
me with an opium drink.


01:27:01.847 --> 01:27:04.449
- It is clear that in your case,


01:27:04.482 --> 01:27:06.919
you need something stronger.


01:27:07.819 --> 01:27:09.854
- No, no, no, no.


01:27:09.887 --> 01:27:10.454
No, no!


01:27:10.487 --> 01:27:11.355
- Hold her still.


01:27:11.388 --> 01:27:13.257
- No, no, no!


01:27:13.290 --> 01:27:15.792
No, no!


01:27:32.972 --> 01:27:34.508
- Let her be for a bit.


01:27:37.210 --> 01:27:38.444
Check back on her in an hour.


01:27:53.356 --> 01:27:56.259
- You better alert
the crematorium.


01:28:00.362 --> 01:28:03.098
- Excuse me, what are you doing?


01:28:03.131 --> 01:28:04.232
- Superintendent Dent?


01:28:04.265 --> 01:28:05.367
- Yes?


01:28:05.400 --> 01:28:07.835
- I am Peter A.
Hendricks esquire.


01:28:07.868 --> 01:28:09.537
I am an attorney
representing a family,


01:28:09.570 --> 01:28:11.372
willing to take
care of the patient,


01:28:11.405 --> 01:28:12.572
known as Nellie Brown.


01:28:12.605 --> 01:28:14.107
- Nellie Brown of course,


01:28:14.140 --> 01:28:16.576
the amnesia case.


01:28:16.609 --> 01:28:21.380
Nellie Brown is unfortunately
a very sick girl


01:28:21.413 --> 01:28:25.183
and I cannot vouch for
the safety of her health.


01:28:25.216 --> 01:28:27.285
If she were to be
released at this time.


01:28:34.991 --> 01:28:38.027
- A Judge Duffy has
signed the order,


01:28:38.060 --> 01:28:41.830
transferring her
into my custody.


01:28:41.863 --> 01:28:45.133
As you can see, it is official.


01:28:49.336 --> 01:28:51.238
- Have a seat.


01:28:51.271 --> 01:28:54.941
We have hundreds of patients
here at Blackwell's,


01:28:54.974 --> 01:28:59.044
it will take a little
time to locate her.


01:28:59.077 --> 01:29:01.046
- I'm not going anywhere.


01:29:01.079 --> 01:29:03.281
- What is the condition
of Nellie Brown?


01:29:03.314 --> 01:29:07.017
- I left Miss McCarten to
take her to the crematorium.


01:29:07.050 --> 01:29:09.119
- Open it, open it!


01:29:12.188 --> 01:29:13.590
Step aside!


01:29:26.433 --> 01:29:30.136
Come Miss Brown,
come back to us.


01:29:30.169 --> 01:29:31.571
Wake up!


01:29:31.604 --> 01:29:32.906
Come out of it!


01:29:32.939 --> 01:29:36.275
Miss Brown, I need
you to wake up!


01:29:49.519 --> 01:29:51.954
- We're ruined.


01:29:51.987 --> 01:29:55.124
Blackwell's will be ended.


01:29:57.358 --> 01:29:59.227
I won't have it.


01:30:11.671 --> 01:30:14.006
- Her heart is beating.


01:30:14.039 --> 01:30:15.240
- What?


01:30:15.273 --> 01:30:16.642
- Her heart is beating!


01:30:19.044 --> 01:30:21.612
- So it works.


01:30:21.645 --> 01:30:24.115
I was right.


01:30:24.148 --> 01:30:27.984
It works.


01:30:28.017 --> 01:30:30.120
Watch over her tonight.


01:30:30.153 --> 01:30:32.588
Make sure she gets
plenty of water.


01:30:32.621 --> 01:30:36.125
At sunrise send
her into the yard.


01:30:36.158 --> 01:30:38.993
Have your nurses keep
close watch over her


01:30:39.026 --> 01:30:40.395
until I call for her.


01:30:40.428 --> 01:30:41.897
- Yes Doctor.


01:30:58.409 --> 01:31:00.945
- Bridget.


01:31:00.978 --> 01:31:02.580
What have they done to you?


01:31:05.182 --> 01:31:08.485
- Insane, it cannot
be seen on your face.


01:31:16.591 --> 01:31:19.360
- Brown, you're to come with me.


01:31:19.393 --> 01:31:20.695
Where am I going?


01:31:20.728 --> 01:31:24.197
- A lawyer, Mr. Hendricks
is here to see you.


01:31:32.137 --> 01:31:36.207
- You are the strongest
woman I have ever met.


01:31:36.240 --> 01:31:38.509
- And you are leaving.


01:31:38.542 --> 01:31:40.510
- I'll be back.


01:31:40.543 --> 01:31:43.180
- No you won't.


01:31:43.213 --> 01:31:47.150
- You'd have to be
crazy to come back here.


01:31:49.318 --> 01:31:53.588
I never want to
see you here again.


01:31:58.158 --> 01:32:00.161
- No hugging.


01:32:12.504 --> 01:32:15.673
- This is Peter A.
Hendricks Esquire.


01:32:15.706 --> 01:32:17.008
He's an attorney.


01:32:17.041 --> 01:32:18.175
- How do you do, Mr. Hendricks.


01:32:18.208 --> 01:32:20.244
- Very well, Miss
Brown thank you.


01:32:20.276 --> 01:32:23.046
- Have a seat Nellie.


01:32:24.714 --> 01:32:29.251
- I represent friends of yours


01:32:29.284 --> 01:32:31.253
that are willing to
take charge of you


01:32:31.286 --> 01:32:32.553
if you'd rather be with them...


01:32:32.586 --> 01:32:33.388
- Yes.


01:32:33.421 --> 01:32:35.256
- Than in the asylum.


01:32:35.289 --> 01:32:36.491
- Yes.


01:32:36.524 --> 01:32:37.325
- Don't you want to
know who they ...


01:32:37.358 --> 01:32:40.027
- No.


01:32:40.060 --> 01:32:42.362
- Very well.


01:32:42.395 --> 01:32:44.397
I will leave you two to chat,


01:32:44.430 --> 01:32:47.700
while I prepare
your release papers.


01:32:52.070 --> 01:32:56.040
- So Miss, Miss Brown.


01:32:56.073 --> 01:32:59.510
Miss Brown, Miss Brown.


01:33:02.211 --> 01:33:05.815
I am instructed to
provide you with anything,


01:33:05.848 --> 01:33:09.484
anything you need on our
journey back to the city.


01:33:09.517 --> 01:33:11.820
- Something to eat immediately.


01:33:11.853 --> 01:33:14.489
- Of course, of course.


01:33:18.324 --> 01:33:19.793
- I had
looked forward so eagerly


01:33:19.826 --> 01:33:22.195
to leaving that horrible place.


01:33:22.228 --> 01:33:24.663
Yet when my release came,


01:33:24.696 --> 01:33:28.600
and I knew that God's sunlight
was to be free for me again,


01:33:28.633 --> 01:33:31.069
there was a certain
pain in leaving.


01:33:31.102 --> 01:33:33.838
- How long was I
in the nuthouse?


01:33:33.871 --> 01:33:37.274
- You mean you don't know?


01:33:41.243 --> 01:33:43.546
- 10 days.


01:34:06.431 --> 01:34:08.266
Could I pass
a week in the Insane Ward


01:34:08.299 --> 01:34:10.468
at Blackwell's island?


01:34:10.501 --> 01:34:12.837
I said I could and would.


01:34:12.870 --> 01:34:16.807
And I did.


01:34:26.414 --> 01:34:28.349
My story spread like wildfire.


01:34:28.382 --> 01:34:30.651
And spread not only
across the U.S.,


01:34:30.684 --> 01:34:32.420
but across the globe.


01:34:32.453 --> 01:34:33.553
I was a news celebrity.


01:34:33.586 --> 01:34:34.855
- Oh Miss Brown.


01:34:34.888 --> 01:34:36.189
I had
proven that a woman


01:34:36.222 --> 01:34:38.258
could do the man's
job of reporting


01:34:38.291 --> 01:34:40.426
by writing the most
successful piece of news


01:34:40.459 --> 01:34:46.298
Joseph Pulitzer
had ever published.


01:34:52.335 --> 01:34:56.139
But my only focus, my only care


01:34:56.172 --> 01:34:59.242
was for the poor unfortunates
left to wither and die


01:34:59.275 --> 01:35:01.511
in that horrid place.


01:35:01.544 --> 01:35:03.745
I was determined to shed
light on their conditions.


01:35:03.778 --> 01:35:05.580
- The nation is in a
fit over your story.


01:35:05.613 --> 01:35:08.349
The mayor of New York has
launched his own investigation


01:35:08.382 --> 01:35:10.484
as of several members
of the city council.


01:35:10.517 --> 01:35:12.386
This changes everything for you.


01:35:12.419 --> 01:35:13.820
- Yes.


01:35:13.853 --> 01:35:17.557
- Nothing will ever be
the same from here on out.


01:35:17.590 --> 01:35:20.359
- No I expect not.


01:35:20.392 --> 01:35:26.131
- Here, this is for you.


01:35:30.401 --> 01:35:31.568
- It is a lot of money.


01:35:31.601 --> 01:35:32.502
- It includes a bonus,


01:35:32.535 --> 01:35:35.572
authorized by Pulitzer himself.


01:35:35.605 --> 01:35:38.207
- I only want the standard pay,


01:35:38.240 --> 01:35:41.377
the rest should
go to the orphans.


01:35:41.410 --> 01:35:44.245
- Oh yes, you've been summoned


01:35:44.278 --> 01:35:45.847
to appear before the grand jury


01:35:45.880 --> 01:35:48.582
about the conditions
at Blackwell's.


01:35:50.984 --> 01:35:52.452
- Do you swear to
tell the truth,


01:35:52.485 --> 01:35:54.453
the whole truth, and
nothing but the truth,


01:35:54.486 --> 01:35:55.488
so help you God?


01:35:55.521 --> 01:35:58.191
- By the grace of God, I do.


01:36:01.659 --> 01:36:03.261
- Please state your name.


01:36:03.294 --> 01:36:05.363
- Elizabeth Jane Cockerit.


01:36:08.365 --> 01:36:10.401
Nellie Bly is my pen name.


01:36:10.434 --> 01:36:12.802
- Can you tell us why
you feigned insanity


01:36:12.835 --> 01:36:14.871
and entered Blackwell's
Island Lunatic Asylum


01:36:14.904 --> 01:36:17.239
posing as a person
of mental illness?


01:36:17.272 --> 01:36:19.408
- I entered Blackwell's
Asylum with the intent


01:36:19.441 --> 01:36:23.444
of writing about and exposing
corruption abuse there of.


01:36:23.477 --> 01:36:26.881
- So this was a page
on dishonest papers?


01:36:26.914 --> 01:36:29.783
- The job of a reporter is to
tell the truth to the people.


01:36:29.816 --> 01:36:32.385
Truth that would
otherwise not be know.


01:36:32.418 --> 01:36:35.354
At first, I took this
assignment with the notion


01:36:35.387 --> 01:36:37.856
of telling the people what
goes on behind the bars


01:36:37.889 --> 01:36:40.525
and locked doors of the asylum.


01:36:40.558 --> 01:36:42.327
But it was not long
before I realized


01:36:42.360 --> 01:36:43.695
that I had deeper reasons.


01:36:43.728 --> 01:36:44.896
- Care to elaborate?


01:36:44.929 --> 01:36:47.664
- The insane asylum
on Blackwell's Island


01:36:47.697 --> 01:36:49.499
is a human rat trap.


01:36:49.532 --> 01:36:51.500
It is easy to get in,


01:36:51.533 --> 01:36:55.805
but once in it is
impossible to get out.


01:36:55.838 --> 01:36:59.774
Here were women taken
without their consent,


01:36:59.807 --> 01:37:02.643
from the free world to an asylum


01:37:02.676 --> 01:37:06.347
and given no chance
to prove their sanity.


01:37:06.380 --> 01:37:08.681
- Your Honor I'm with that the
Grand Jury be taken on a tour


01:37:08.714 --> 01:37:11.251
of Blackwell's Island
Asylum by Miss Cockerin


01:37:11.284 --> 01:37:13.553
and see these events first hand.


01:37:13.586 --> 01:37:14.519
- It is so ordered.


01:37:21.625 --> 01:37:24.562
- The Grand Jury is here.


01:37:24.595 --> 01:37:25.795
- Yes?


01:37:25.828 --> 01:37:30.333
- We must eliminate all
traces of Brown's visit.


01:37:30.366 --> 01:37:32.534
We are in danger.


01:37:32.567 --> 01:37:32.968
- Just go.


01:37:33.001 --> 01:37:33.669
- But...


01:37:33.702 --> 01:37:34.704
- Just go!


01:37:52.851 --> 01:37:54.653
- You must keep
your questions short


01:37:54.686 --> 01:37:57.589
as her health will not allow it.


01:37:59.691 --> 01:38:03.728
- It's me Nellie.


01:38:05.329 --> 01:38:08.398
Tillie do you know me?


01:38:08.431 --> 01:38:11.000
- No.


01:38:11.033 --> 01:38:12.901
I do not know you.


01:38:17.339 --> 01:38:18.606
Should I?


01:38:36.654 --> 01:38:39.324
- This is not how it was
when I was last here.


01:38:39.357 --> 01:38:41.558
- Have you made changes to
the sitting room recently?


01:38:41.591 --> 01:38:42.959
- The sitting room is
always being changed,


01:38:42.992 --> 01:38:44.995
rearranged and cleaned.


01:38:45.028 --> 01:38:46.862
- Where is Miss
Bridget McGuinness?


01:38:46.895 --> 01:38:48.831
- She has been transferred
to other quarters.


01:38:48.864 --> 01:38:50.333
- What about Mrs. Fox?


01:38:50.366 --> 01:38:54.102
- She is dying of paralysis
and you cannot see her.


01:38:54.135 --> 01:38:57.339
- And Anne Neville,
where is Anne Neville.


01:38:57.372 --> 01:38:59.473
- She has been transferred
to isolation in Hall 7


01:38:59.506 --> 01:39:00.674
due to some troubles.


01:39:00.707 --> 01:39:01.742
- See that she is brought to us.


01:39:12.050 --> 01:39:14.720
- Miss Anne Neville
has been brought down.


01:39:14.753 --> 01:39:16.020
She's in the hallway.


01:39:16.053 --> 01:39:17.088
- Send her in.


01:39:41.107 --> 01:39:44.777
- I knew you would come back.


01:39:46.445 --> 01:39:49.115
- Have they been
giving you medicine?


01:39:53.518 --> 01:39:54.853
- I have to admit,


01:39:54.886 --> 01:39:58.856
I was fearful when they
came for me just now.


01:39:58.889 --> 01:40:02.625
They said I was going to be
examined by a crowd of men.


01:40:02.658 --> 01:40:04.460
- It is a Grand Jury,


01:40:04.493 --> 01:40:08.964
here to investigate Blackwell's
and how they treat us.


01:40:08.997 --> 01:40:10.799
- All I want you to do,


01:40:10.832 --> 01:40:13.033
is to tell the jury
all that we have done


01:40:13.066 --> 01:40:15.370
since I was brought
with you to the asylum.


01:40:27.012 --> 01:40:31.649
- When Miss Brown and
I were brought here,


01:40:33.751 --> 01:40:36.053
the nurses were very cruel.


01:40:40.089 --> 01:40:43.760
The food it was too bad to eat.


01:40:46.028 --> 01:40:48.897
There was not enough clothing.


01:40:48.930 --> 01:40:52.634
Miss Brown asked for
more all the time.


01:40:52.667 --> 01:40:54.868
For when the doctors
promised her more clothing,


01:40:54.901 --> 01:41:00.907
she said she would
give it to me.


01:41:05.477 --> 01:41:11.048
Strange to say,


01:41:14.952 --> 01:41:19.088
ever since Miss Brown
has been taken away,


01:41:19.121 --> 01:41:22.991
everything was different.


01:41:23.024 --> 01:41:26.628
Nurses are very kind to us


01:41:26.661 --> 01:41:30.865
and we are given plenty to wear.


01:41:30.898 --> 01:41:36.970
The doctors come
and see us often.


01:41:41.573 --> 01:41:43.876
- All rise


01:41:43.909 --> 01:41:49.514
for the honorable Judge
Henry A. Gildersleeve.


01:41:53.917 --> 01:41:55.886
Be seated.


01:41:59.121 --> 01:42:02.624
- Has the Grand Jury
reached a decision?


01:42:02.657 --> 01:42:05.827
- We have Your Honor.


01:42:05.860 --> 01:42:07.762
We find the Committee
of Appropriation


01:42:07.795 --> 01:42:09.196
be provided one million dollars


01:42:09.229 --> 01:42:10.865
for the benefit of the asylum.


01:42:14.300 --> 01:42:15.935
In spite of
the attempts to cover up


01:42:15.968 --> 01:42:18.204
what had been going
on at Blackwell's,


01:42:18.237 --> 01:42:21.039
the Grand Jury found that
I was telling the truth


01:42:21.072 --> 01:42:22.808
about all I had testified


01:42:22.841 --> 01:42:26.110
and found my testimony
to be credible.


01:42:26.143 --> 01:42:29.146
I have the consolation that
on the strength of my story,


01:42:29.179 --> 01:42:31.548
the million dollars
per year provided


01:42:31.581 --> 01:42:33.283
was more than had
ever before been given


01:42:33.316 --> 01:42:36.086
for the benefit of the insane.


01:42:36.119 --> 01:42:41.123
- My dear girl, you have
no idea what you've done.


01:42:41.557 --> 01:42:44.692
- Oh I know exactly
what I have done.


01:42:44.725 --> 01:42:46.928
Blackwell's is not
a place of healing.


01:42:46.961 --> 01:42:49.263
It is a rat-infested
human death trap.


01:42:49.296 --> 01:42:51.098
- That is due to
the lack of means


01:42:51.131 --> 01:42:53.934
to secure good medical help.


01:42:53.967 --> 01:42:56.202
Blackwell's Asylum
was forced to choose


01:42:56.235 --> 01:43:00.605
among convicted prisoners
from the nearby penitentiary


01:43:00.638 --> 01:43:02.707
to fill out its staff.


01:43:02.740 --> 01:43:06.277
- You stood by as the nurses
inflicted unspeakable cruelties


01:43:06.310 --> 01:43:07.611
upon patients.


01:43:07.644 --> 01:43:09.280
- Maybe being the
superintendent,


01:43:09.313 --> 01:43:12.882
I was too busy to be fully
aware of the atrocities


01:43:12.915 --> 01:43:14.284
that were going on in here.


01:43:14.317 --> 01:43:16.152
- You knew.


01:43:16.185 --> 01:43:18.120
You knew that clothing
meant for the patients


01:43:18.153 --> 01:43:19.621
was being stolen.


01:43:19.654 --> 01:43:21.990
You knew that women in
here were being murdered.


01:43:22.023 --> 01:43:24.825
- How can you say it was murder!


01:43:24.858 --> 01:43:27.295
I was trying to
help these people!


01:43:27.328 --> 01:43:34.134
I was trying to help
science before it!


01:43:38.070 --> 01:43:41.606
- Dr. Dent you have
made a very old mistake.


01:43:41.639 --> 01:43:43.074
Throughout history
there have been those


01:43:43.107 --> 01:43:44.309
who have allowed atrocities


01:43:44.342 --> 01:43:48.679
with a higher ideal
as an end goal.


01:43:48.712 --> 01:43:52.215
- I had no other goal
than to help my patients.


01:43:54.283 --> 01:43:56.619
- I can see I cannot
convince you to the insanity


01:43:56.652 --> 01:44:00.221
of your thinking.


01:44:00.254 --> 01:44:02.824
But I can stop you.


01:44:02.857 --> 01:44:06.794
The state is taking control
of Blackwell's Asylum.


01:44:06.827 --> 01:44:10.063
One of the conditions is
that the facility be closed


01:44:10.096 --> 01:44:11.097
and torn down.


01:44:26.376 --> 01:44:32.081
Goodbye Dr. Dent.


01:44:35.851 --> 01:44:38.686
- The world
was surprised by my story.


01:44:38.719 --> 01:44:40.922
A story written by a woman.


01:44:40.955 --> 01:44:44.324
A story that brought light
to those that had no voice,


01:44:44.357 --> 01:44:47.227
those that society had forgotten


01:44:47.260 --> 01:44:49.162
and reminded us all


01:44:49.195 --> 01:44:52.164
that energy rightly
applied and directed


01:44:52.197 --> 01:44:53.866
will accomplish anything.


